{\"ad_archive_id\":\"1212899354182423\",\"collation_count\":1,\"collation_id\":\"602662519206009\",\"page_id\":\"103614551428466\",\"snapshot\":{\"branded_content\":{\"page_id\":\"103614551428466\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/megelinofficial/\",\"page_name\":\"Megelin\"},\"page_id\":\"215064076014115\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/bevsbeautyreviews/\",\"root_reshared_post\":null,\"byline\":\"\",\"disclaimer_label\":null,\"page_name\":\"Beverly Blair\",\"page_profile_picture_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/489018618_1680761852514928_3540716825204302299_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=lKmw2ErrzMgQ7kNvwHLnU_a&_nc_oc=Adryi_1G23bo1fKwmYxDT0rwsEk3sO27sDFK7i6V6KwHGQ0Af-dwRvB4zDbvt7FuUUvMCcKleEsTZbOLIW-LjcJg&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=xYj0uHfXfaEUd15JPmcclQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af6_qWvPReaB9aN5lQA7DUzhi8TK62phOG5PTAX9nYUZRg&oe=6A0668AF\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"megelin.com\",\"cta_text\":\"Shop now\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"\\ud83c\\udf1f Join me as I embark on an incredible journey with the Megelin LED Light Therapy Machine! \\u0040megelinofficial\\n\\n\\u2728 Experience the magic of light therapy with the power of the Megelin LED Light Therapy Machine. \\u2728\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udd34 Red Light (630-660nm): Say goodbye to aging woes and bid adieu to those pesky dark circles. Rediscover youthful radiance with the anti-aging properties of the red light.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udd35 Blue Light (460nm): Unwind and tighten your skin with the calming and rejuvenating blue light. Let it soothe your senses and restore your skin's natural beauty.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udc9b Yellow Light (590nm): Illuminate your skin and say goodbye to spots as the yellow light works to lighten and whiten your complexion. Embrace a brighter and more vibrant skin tone.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udc9a Green Light (550nm): Find the perfect balance of pigment as the green light helps reduce redness and even out your skin tone. Embrace a more harmonious complexion.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udc9c Purple Light (420nm): Indulge in relaxation while rejuvenating your skin. Experience the wonders of the purple light as it improves the appearance of dull and tired skin.\\n\\n\\ud83c\\udf08 Cyan Light (490nm): Unleash the power of cell metabolism with the revitalizing cyan light. Boost your skin's natural radiance and embrace a healthier glow.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udd06 Near-Infra Light (850nm): Awaken your skin's vitality with the near-infrared light. Experience accelerated blood circulation and nourish your skin with oxygen and nutrients.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udce3And the best part? The Megelin LED Light Therapy Machine is now on SALE for just $139 (originally $399)! Don't miss out on this incredible deal. \\ud83c\\udf1f\\n\\n\\ud83d\\uded2Megelin.com use code Beverly10:10\\u0025 off\\n\\n\\u2728 Join me on this transformative journey and unlock the secrets of beautiful and healthy skin with the Megelin LED Light Therapy Machine. \\u2728\\ud83d\\udcab\\n*kindlygifted \\n\\n#LEDLightTherapy #SkincareRevolution #HealthySkinJourney #MegelinTherapyMachine #GlowingSkin #BeautyFromWithin\"},\"cta_type\":\"SHOP_NOW\",\"display_format\":\"IMAGE\",\"link_description\":\"The LED Machine bring the professional light therapy experience typically found in salons into your home. With its U-shaped design, it allows users to enjoy light therapy for various parts of the body, promoting overall wellness at home. This device is an FDA Class II medical device with ILY code, o...\",\"link_url\":\"https://megelin.com/products/megelin-led-light-therapy-machine\",\"images\":[{\"image_crops\":[],\"original_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/489027579_1514928909480807_2906330643979778647_n.jpg?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=qhJ8vsTCJTwQ7kNvwHKF73J&_nc_oc=Adqg8ufB-kLEGIVyS_REheE9eR2b8YJy-8bVuYV061lTtx50ZRdjbGC0lHCVmRhNfDvU