713 Health Testing and Healthy Ageing\\n\\u2713 Red Light Therapy\\n\\u2713 IV Drip Therapy\\n\\u2713 Lymphatic Drainage\\n\\u2713 Cryotherapy\\n\\u2713 Infrared Sauna\\n\\nEvery patient journey begins with a personalised consultation. Our clinicians take the time to assess your current health, discuss your goals and recommend the most suitable treatment plan for your needs.\\n\\nTake the first step towards improved wellbeing, greater energy and a healthier future.\"},\"cta_type\":\"LEARN_MORE\",\"display_format\":\"IMAGE\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"http://fb.me/\",\"images\":[{\"image_crops\":[],\"original_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/651188080_2264919560980697_3773871184060647013_n.jpg?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=l2_x9vI7RvQQ7kNvwGtY5PO&_nc_oc=Ado_gxbYhlpwG1QQoW0pd2NZU4cMB3w0cJKbI_f9KARQTgwRMy9M7MLJ0GplJISJR0loYSP_brlTAPrRqP20VA16&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna&_nc_gid=xYj0uHfXfaEUd15JPmcclQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af75pxwl98juHPnD4eh5BDaZUBLUK_ModcYbRXExe0PBvg&oe=6A0689A7\",\"resized_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/653175905_922376633727942_2587286179719746993_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=I9Jz8-KbLUoQ7kNvwH0zyRE&_nc_oc=AdqrQbjUPM6lNGsh1AwP28LZUhuynxZ1hfcnkKoDZSZll4x7Pl8nhzmCBzMJW5V1E9w08A10fObsB18VkgyY7cD_&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=xYj0uHfXfaEUd15JPmcclQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af4VCE1B3qClNmzt3kcWG0QlsIExyhdoA_qBHWgqBR6-LA&oe=6A068739\",\"watermarked_resized_image_url\":\"\"}],\"page_categories\":[\"Medical Service\"],\"page_like_count\":2393,\"title\":\"Coleraine, Premium Wellness Treatments\",\"videos\":[],\"is_reshared\":false,\"extra_links\":[\"https://luxmedics.co.uk/\",\"https://luxmedics.co.uk/privacy-policy/\",\"https://luxmedics.co.uk/\"],\"extra_texts\":[{\"text\":\"Coleraine, Northern Ireland - FREE Initial Consultation\"},{\"text\":\"Wellness Treatments, in Coleraine, Northern Ireland\\n\