ount\":4,\"collation_id\":\"624995170518613\",\"page_id\":\"103614551428466\",\"snapshot\":{\"branded_content\":{\"page_id\":\"103614551428466\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/megelinofficial/\",\"page_name\":\"Megelin\"},\"page_id\":\"116354658237621\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/61553104926064/\",\"root_reshared_post\":null,\"byline\":\"\",\"disclaimer_label\":null,\"page_name\":\"Jules Horn\",\"page_profile_picture_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/670008790_1291925949547160_2086863954945050528_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=K-goJqZrZVEQ7kNvwEPnDHC&_nc_oc=Adp0ntdEVtDuRkLtk7TuVZ6IjuBs4xxAXT1Pn3Wm6YDSpe5Q_jAI__0uz0dnHQMvy189znz-YyEUZfND0TWG6OZU&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna&_nc_gid=e2xYN4Z63Px3FgV3TfQPIQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af76ZqSSXjtV6GFBwUTCfmyDeinfYt6sbJjFhrSGV-Efgg&oe=6A066716\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"megelin.com\",\"cta_text\":\"Shop now\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"Here\\u2019s why I use the \\u0040megelinofficial Red Light Sack:\\n\\nIt combines two powerful wavelengths:\\n\\nred light (630nm - 660nm) and near-infrared light (810nm - 850nm), to target both surface-level recovery and deep tissue healing.\\n\\nRed Light (630nm - 660nm):\\n\\n\\u2022 Penetrates the skin\\u2019s surface layers, enhancing collagen production, promoting wound healing, and reducing inflammation.\\n\\u2022 Effective for reducing oxidative stress, which speeds up recovery from muscle damage and skin irritation.\\n\\u2022 Improves skin tone, elasticity, and overall resilience, which is essential when pushing the body to its limits.\\n\\nNear-Infrared Light (810nm - 850nm):\\n\\n\\u2022 Reaches deeper into muscles, joints, and connective tissues, stimulating cellular energy production (ATP) at a fundamental level.\\n\\u2022 Enhances blood flow and oxygen delivery to the muscles, improving endurance, power output, and recovery speed.\\n\\u2022 Proven to support cognitive function by enhancing blood flow to the brain, improving mental clarity, reaction time, and focus.\\n\\u2022 Alleviates joint stiffness, pain, and inflammation, making it critical for injury prevention and recovery from high-intensity training.\\n\\nBy addressing both surface-level and deep-tissue recovery, this combination allows for a more comprehensive approach to performance enhancement. Instead of just focusing on muscle recovery, it tackles systemic inflammation, energy production, and cognitive performance.\\n\\nUsing red light therapy regularly means I can train harder, recover faster, and stay mentally sharp. It\\u2019s become an essential part of my routine for enhancing performance and keeping my body operating at its best.\\n\\nIf you interested in getting yourself one of those devices, use code Juergen5 for 5\\u0025 off \\n\\n#heal #training #redlight #love #life #megelin #fitness #recovery #love #life #reels #viral\"},\"cta_type\":\"SHOP_NOW\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"https://megelin.com/products/megelin-red-and-infrared-light-therapy-bag-1\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Entrepreneur\"],\"page_like_count\":935000,\"title\":null,\"videos\":[{\"video_hd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQMO5fPXn7Sq6CQdx4dMJnVPVjryV0jSRraJ2kuFkwCiMSrRLnmlq0bVRyhUMPQLC5BOZJP6_bTDcgINGgPTrFs_UCtGx5ZFf2TNqo1udGX-9g.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdpAwGQ1eEAYi26HXWIg2ROx27EbuU2iezDnH-cSSfh1wpwlnseY9YBpK-_1MST2ikdraoh3SzQWkIrqAw0BdjVf&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=_cYEQHOT58sQ7kNvwE1zW9R&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHAiLCJ4cHZfYXNzZXRfaWQiOjE2OTU2MDU4NjQ3MTU5ODksImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjo0MDQsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMTIzLCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjo2LCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0\\u00253D&ccb=17-1&vs=ec4f02dc6beb3907&_nc_&_nc_gid=e2xY