ecovery & wellness protocols to help you feel better now \\u2014 and age well long term. With HBOT \\u2022 PEMF \\u2022 Infrared, we support energy, sleep, easier movement, and the habits that underpin longevity so you can stay active, strong, and sharp for years. \\n\\nShare a few details and we\\u2019ll line up a quick 5-minute call to chat about how we can help you.\"},{\"text\":\"Enter your details below and we'll be in touch.\"},{\"text\":\"Which treatment are you interested in?\"},{\"text\":\"Infrared Therapy\"},{\"text\":\"Hyperbaric Oxygen Therapy\"},{\"text\":\"PEMF Therapy\"},{\"text\":\"Massage Therapy\"},{\"text\":\"What town are you living?\"},{\"text\":\"Have you used these therapies before?\"},{\"text\":\"Do you have any medical conditions?\"},{\"text\":\"Full name\"},{\"text\":\"Email\"},{\"text\":\"Phone number\"},{\"text\":\"Terms and Conditions for Optimal Health at Inspire\"},{\"text\":\"Visit Optimal Health & Recovery at Inspire's Privacy Policy.\"},{\"text\":\"Thanks, we'll reach out as soon as possible.\"},{\"text\":\"You can visit our website or exit the form now.\"}],\"extra_images\":[],\"extra_videos\":[],\"country_iso_code\":null,\"brazil_tax_id\":null,\"additional_info\":null,\"ec_certificates\":[]},\"is_active\":true,\"has_user_reported\":false,\"report_count\":null,\"menu_items\":[],\"state_media_run_label\":null,\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_name\":\"Optimal Health at Inspire\",\"impressions_with_index\":{\"impressions_text\":null,\"impressions_index\":-1},\"gated_type\":\"ELIGIBLE\",\"categories\":[\"UNKNOWN\"],\"is_aaa_eligible\":true,\"contains_digital_created_media\":false,\"reach_estimate\":null,\"currency\":\"\",\"spend\":null,\"end_date\":1778396400,\"publisher_platform\":[\"FACEBOOK\",\"INSTAGRAM\",\"AUDIENCE_NETWORK\"],\"start_date\":1776236400,\"contains_sensitive_content\":false,\"total_active_time\":null,\"regional_regulation_data\":{\"finserv\":{\"is_deemed_finserv\":false,\"is_limited_delivery\":false},\"tw_anti_scam\":{\"is_limited_delivery\":false}},\"hide_data_status\":\"NONE\",\"fev_info\":null,\"ad_id\":null,\"targeted_or_reached_countries\":[]}],\"__typename\":\"CollatedSearchResults\"},\"cursor\":null},{\"node\":{\"collated_results\":[{\"ad_archive_id\":\"2042608732990262\",\"collation_count\":1,\"collation_id\":\"1127656456163513\",\"page_id\":\"360373860492555\",\"snapshot\":{\"branded_content\":null,\"page_id\":\"360373860492555\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/healray.official/\",\"root_reshared_post\":null,\"byline\":null,\"disclaimer_label\":null,\"page_name\":\"HealRay\",\"page_profile_picture_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/658144873_977366708007440_2464989346778829854_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=Xr24rqQ0A7AQ7kNvwGfUI1r&_nc_oc=AdqZA61tFVqUal3AXDhFst3_Z3WmXUQNTEXdTVjlXe8R2dBUaRQrstkCUqwvqHh57tKg8ZgLNph9WAtsOvLveOVd&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=Q3qGSc4ezHPvjDfOi-POKg&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af77NZJMxA-zTgJvUWAJXtKOCk6Tkj1mv2c9LuACYwByrQ&oe=6A067FB4\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"www.myhealray.com\",\"cta_text\":\"Learn more\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"Receding gums aren\\u2019t just about brushing harder or flossing more.\\n\\nThey\\u2019re often linked to collagen breakdown and chronic inflammation.\\n\\nHealRay uses targeted red and infrared light to support gum tissue at the source - right from home.\\n\\n\\u2705 Supports healthier gum structure\\n\\u2705 Helps calm irritation and sensitivity\\n\\u2705 Takes just 5 minutes a day\\n\\nLearn what\\u2019s really happening inside receding gums \\u2192 https://www.myhealray.com/dental-news-advertorial\"},\"cta_type\":\"LEARN_MORE\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"https://www.myhealray.com/dental-news-advertorial\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Cosmetic Dentist\"],\"page_like_count\":2610,\"title\":\"Try It Risk Free For 60 Days\",\"videos\":