\":\"102214142623054\",\"snapshot\":{\"branded_content\":null,\"page_id\":\"102214142623054\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/theonedevice/\",\"root_reshared_post\":null,\"byline\":null,\"disclaimer_label\":null,\"page_name\":\"The One Device\",\"page_profile_picture_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/659296378_1264274988556149_7028165943618743518_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=eKT-xzMNxSkQ7kNvwEewhg2&_nc_oc=Adp5WTqEH8Wgw27ZWHfVnPPQkHhz3oak-GPUK3jFUNcGyPaIVGJ_TaEPcWzsAbyO2zqVblSLZjUQV6-TGA-RIhH0&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna&_nc_gid=Q3qGSc4ezHPvjDfOi-POKg&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af77A7EoWXKN3haI7SzG9OXKqtVLtWamdhVVxqweAH9g8w&oe=6A066BF8\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"theonedevice.com\",\"cta_text\":\"Shop now\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"Introducing The One: a wearable biotuning device designed to restore your natural bioharmonic balance using a fusion of light, sound, and vibrational therapy. We have been working on this product for 3 years, and couldn\\u2019t be more excited to bring it to you!\\n\\nWhat is The One?\\nIt\\u2019s a wearable device that looks like jewelry and combines:\\n\\u2705 Light Therapy \\u2013 through LED and infrared light, known to support cellular repair, reduce inflammation, and enhance mitochondrial function.\\n\\u2705 Sound Therapy \\u2013 Solfeggio Frequencies interact with your body\\u2019s biofield, optimizing mental clarity, stress resilience, and emotional balance.\\n\\u2705 Vibrating Crystals \\u2013 shungite & clear quartz, housed in a copper casing, offer grounding and EMF protection, ensuring deep biofield restoration.\\n\\n\\ud83e\\udd1d If you don\\u2019t love our product, we offer a 90-day money-back guarantee!\\n\\nFree shipping in the US: https://theonedevice.com\"},\"cta_type\":\"SHOP_NOW\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"https://theonedevice.com/\",\"images\":[],\"pa