_post\":null,\"byline\":null,\"disclaimer_label\":null,\"page_name\":\"Luke Storey - The Life Stylist Podcast\",\"page_profile_picture_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/672682915_1481694520295933_9191277585598166948_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=UrlN6VZylZkQ7kNvwG5ugsb&_nc_oc=Adq28BorKTbWDNO2MAhFWWcYWkMKqqkeyT3POPWIVulSpGYNUKzpzwqkzR9B-Jd0J3fcmzDBOc8e8tYqQP7f3PGP&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna&_nc_gid=Q3qGSc4ezHPvjDfOi-POKg&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af44SW_9BsT7nvUSP3cGQSIt6sGZmERuxRLkrTleX4HJrQ&oe=6A065EB4\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"theonedevice.com\",\"cta_text\":\"Shop now\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"Nobody\\u2019s talking about bioharmonic imbalance \\u2014 but it might explain why you\\u2019re tired all the time, wired but can\\u2019t focus, and stressed even when nothing is technically wrong.\\nYou\\u2019ve tried the supplements. The breathwork. The screen-time rules. Still feel off.\\n\\nHere\\u2019s what no one told you: your body runs on frequencies. When those frequencies get disrupted \\u2014 by stress, by EMFs, by the pace of modern life \\u2014 no surface-level fix reaches the root.\\n\\nThe One is a wearable device that heals your biofield using:\\nLight therapy (cellular repair + inflammation)\\nSound therapy (nervous system recalibration)\\nVibrating crystals (grounding + EMF protection)\\nIt looks like jewelry. You wear it and forget about it. \\ud83d\\udcab\\nDon\\u2019t feel different in 90 days? Full refund. No questions.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udce6 Free US shipping \\u2192 theonedevice.com\"},\"cta_type\":\"SHOP_NOW\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"http://theonedevice.com/\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Music\",\"Digital creator\"],\"page_like_count\":142,\"title\":\"Tried Everything? You Haven\\u2019t Tried This.\",\"videos\":[{\"video_hd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQNEdxv6m9q9YCZfRcrjjkT2cs