e skin to support collagen and cellular repair\\n\\ud83d\\udd34 850nm near-infrared light reaches deeper into muscle and joint tissue\\n\\ud83d\\udd34 Both wavelengths are used in clinical settings worldwide\\n\\nLumiRed is Ireland's first dedicated red light therapy brand - founded by a physiotherapist who uses this technology with real patients.\\n\\nFree express delivery across the island of Ireland.\\n\\nStill not sure? Watch our Q&A video - we answer the real questions.\\n\\nShop at lumired.ie\"},\"cta_type\":\"LEARN_MORE\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":\"Founded by an Irish physio\",\"link_url\":\"https://lumired.ie/\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Shopping\"],\"page_like_count\":497,\"title\":\"Physio-Founded. Science-Backed.\",\"videos\":[{\"video_hd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQNdhP86cw3z_qQhZmbNJ56SIgYYFxna14uMDFhZuT3r7uceqLYoX95mV1JbBJPfhS8mwY5cseKImylY_fBeOLLS3Y6PM8Za9YPbCtyWc0EOvQ.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdoqilQk--c7lugqpejAIYLvD6t8l7bpXPLxdZ2wLehZRzt0rECBlNILkTAWqcHH7NsxT-ndjuIJqBop15BYByQ7&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=x0eXIVLCOLAQ7kNvwESHkvM&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuMTI4MC5kYXNoX2gyNjQtYmFzaWMtZ2VuMl83MjBwIiwieHB2X2Fzc2V0X2lkIjo5ODkzMjQ0MjY5ODkxNDksImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjoyMywidmlfdXNlY2FzZV9pZCI6MTA3OTksImR1cmF0aW9uX3MiOjE2MSwidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&vs=bd816d155a99429b&_nc_&_nc_gid=YYXzXCQhVFgo9vcsCVpIqA&_nc_ss=7b2a8&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_Af4KyaV3XfXt7YHCp4DUV-UDH0tmW9MNB4VLrPLfDugh9A&oe=6A066353\",\"video_preview_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/674215713_1627343781863881_1505177401095289039_n.jpg?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=23ngwCMkE7gQ7kNvwHg7V4o&_nc_oc=AdqSZviUge41ysz74d05_aBQlXE3CQ6wXRK54OiQzg6qGD2konfCv_Uiiu4sP3ZbqssPtSerWsmJsdBZgcTlP-if&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=YYXzXCQhVFgo9vcsCVpIqA&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af7wYGqyIdLpGn