e\":\"CollatedSearchResults\"},\"cursor\":null},{\"node\":{\"collated_results\":[{\"ad_archive_id\":\"1317717703642834\",\"collation_count\":1,\"collation_id\":\"26476553238661576\",\"page_id\":\"742442385884177\",\"snapshot\":{\"branded_content\":{\"page_id\":\"742442385884177\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/projectebeauty/\",\"page_name\":\"Project E Beauty\"},\"page_id\":\"628127317055010\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/61576218384673/\",\"root_reshared_post\":null,\"byline\":\"\",\"disclaimer_label\":null,\"page_name\":\"Itsalfieandme\",\"page_profile_picture_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/686343668_1267955128869093_3392149329707177223_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=TgvhQr9EyLIQ7kNvwEv8qap&_nc_oc=AdrqSlOJsj4e78giu3O4WDgq-AFxisYIko1fwcgDcTOIBMEaJjaucFT8dzu_Lx1Q0G2Tz32fhlWHovCnJ7kd8L7A&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna&_nc_gid=YYXzXCQhVFgo9vcsCVpIqA&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af5NwYYWVkWEBQNyTvVwHFIyb-mnuSKLhICfVlBXjnmtHw&oe=6A065D34\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"www.projectebeauty.com\",\"cta_text\":\"Shop now\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"Who said boys aren\\u2019t in their wellness era too? \\ud83e\\udd2d\\n\\nAlfie is also obsessed with our new \\u0040projectebeauty wellness routine lol. Because, one, we can do it together (he\\u2019s a velcro dog), and two, it supports him living a longer, healthier life (again, he\\u2019s a velcro dog so he never wants to leave me) \\ud83d\\ude2d \\n\\nA few of our favourite features:\\n\\n\\ud83e\\udd0e 7 LED colour modes, with red and infrared being the key standout modes for pet use\\n\\ud83e\\uddf8 The most relevant settings for pets are red light and infrared light, using 630nm and 850nm wavelengths \\u2014 commonly used in pet red light therapy\\n\\ud83d\\udc36 The ultra-wide curved design covers a larger area, so Alfie can comfortably lie underneath during our self-care sessions\\n\\ud83e\\udef6\\ud83c\\udffd Red light therapy supports healthy ageing (for both humans and pets)\\n\\nWe love doing this together, but always check with your vet first to confirm suitability for your pet. While the device is designed for humans, it makes a great shared wellness tool for both owners and their dogs \\ud83e\\udd79\\n\\nEnjoy 15\\u0025 off with code: ALFIE \\n\\n#cockerspaniel #dogsofig #redlighttherapy #petcare #parishilton AD\"},\"cta_type\":\"SHOP_NOW\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"https://www.projectebeauty.com/products/lumalux-dome-face-body-led-light-therapy-device\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Digital Creator\",\"Animals & Pets\"],\"page_like_count\":26170,\"title\":null,\"videos\":[{\"video_hd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m367/AQN4hLY7mDzN2NEfyR4L1HiVyoqiMucFCw4clC7Yfcj05aogwhPgoaGLp3JjD4NOGux_wrW8YLjlyj6qqQm3Ept7VEPxWQWPRx_to16r9Q.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdqBZEMolqb67XTJ5oGBhOCf2hdDT1t2yDXm1I4olCI0d96Vcrx1uLV1GXWuj5IR5ec__awZZo36TdeidovN0by_&_nc_sid=8bf8fe&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=o7TXYtcSRnkQ7kNvwE2VzQ5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLnByb2dyZXNzaXZlX2gyNjQtYmFzaWMtZ2VuMl83MjBwIiwieHB2X2Fzc2V0X2lkIjoxNzg5NTY5NzI4NzQ0MTI3OCwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjIwLCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6NTMsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ\\u00253D\\u00253D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=YYXzXCQhVFgo9vcsCVpIqA&_nc_ss=7b2a8&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_Af6V-n9G4wyWbb399nDmqwI08x_i8g03JJUEzt5hPR4zxA&oe=6A065C2E\",\"video_preview_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/686215424_4650394928527296_6638944386792540070_n.jpg?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=ZaouPz-O-BwQ7kNvwHN8zU3&_nc_oc=AdqGtHTu7hsZpizgVrSpVi68VIJBj14ktKyFSlLqA3nwRkrS6pYZAbfzaxadNE50n_AHpPtade654YJt9XCKBlhz&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=YYXzXCQhVFgo9vcsCVpIqA&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af7erSpXrdtqh