 a hair dryer.\\n\\ud83d\\udd2c How it works:\\n1\\ufe0f\\u20e3 100x laser energy density via comb-guide teeth \\u2013 reaches the bulge region\\n2\\ufe0f\\u20e3 800\\u20131800nm NIR revitalizes scalp environment, prolongs growth phase\\n3\\ufe0f\\u20e3 Collagen XVII + milk exosomes \\u2013 anchor hair strands at the root level\\n\\nNot a gimmick. Real photobiomodulation + actives.\\nLab data: -11\\u0025 combing loss, +13\\u0025 visual volume*\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udee1\\ufe0f 90-day price protection | 60-day returns | 1-year warranty\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udd17 Explore the science of follicle regeneration.\"},\"cta_type\":\"SEE_DETAILS\",\"display_format\":\"IMAGE\",\"link_description\":\"Experience revolutionary hair growth with our advanced Light Therapy Hair Comb. Featuring 100x energy density and comb-guided delivery, it precisely drives red light and near-infrared (NIR) wavelengths deep into the follicles, activating them from surface to root. The dual-spectrum HLLT technology c...\",\"link_url\":\"https://jovs.com/products/hllt-hair-density-dryer\",\"images\":[{\"image_crops\":[],\"original_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/690751135_2804967936512633_2670418610055186684_n.jpg?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=2aJRNJLlKF8Q7kNvwFj8TZe&_nc_oc=AdqCJQ9cR-jeDNRqAfNKxcS2J5CA4aBEdEBtMP9FRnIofgXesY_ihG18_rwxQ3ZcWyw6VOK2q5OV2CijzyJDq13G&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna&_nc_gid=YYXzXCQhVFgo9vcsCVpIqA&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af6Hi3HWBIOcgh8j2wbkdWIm1HFoPsmGUjZ-Qq94rzEZfQ&oe=6A066778\",\"resized_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/696394771_950663797768591_1567699325371196634_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=kFxj_0mqnRQQ7kNvwFhIE4j&_nc_oc=AdqvsXZbN9scoTIXunSocqlRK5j1R_0-YZdKQPhr--Cm71MV8tEwPzN_Tf9k5HSMLjm4JUYTYOHbSgdQwFM-rsGk&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna&_nc_gid=YYXzXCQhVFgo9vcsCVpIqA&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af66M4OGO4b9Ako2Z4qOIEMAUlmdb63Pf7Lrcs_R2nuuBA&oe=6A0686AB\",\"