0515890_18059155376647133_7242498096101849078_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s206x206_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=525117&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4zMjQuQzMifQ\\u00253D\\u00253D&_nc_ohc=bU10xdX2lEoQ7kNvwGI2CK7&_nc_oc=Adohz6zIPoIdx46RYp5yKeSkRTqIEqFmZgW9hr_1YvtTmUiga9Whxhcy4xz44pR4qp-0VfSoQWZuOCU7d6bfePZs&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=WMJpnBc_Ba85Rm55aQroMQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af5BIDyY4l3E-E0YC6DcBV3iY22-VDt0ywhakA6bG7fMfw&oe=6A066E45\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"instagram.com\",\"cta_text\":\"Visit Instagram profile\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"Delighted to add another exciting Touchlesss Therapy to our facilities, we feel this is again a \\\"Gamer changer\\\" for some many of our clients in assisting with their Wellness is a natural way.\\n\\nWhat is Pressotherapy?\\n\\nits a gentle, non-invasive treatment that uses air pressure to gentle massage your body, a soothing rhythmic hug for your whole body\\n\\nAre you feeling bloated, heavy, or just fatigued, this is the therapy you have been waiting for. Its a lymphatic drainage massage suit that uses gentle air pressure to help stimulate your lymphatic system, assisting Detox, increased circulation, leaving you feeling lighter, energized and body balanced.\\n\\nThe main benefits are;\\n\\nReduces water retention and swelling.\\nImproves circulation and recovery\\nEases muscle tension.\\nBoosts lymphatic drainage.\\nDetoxes the body.\\n\\nWatch out for more details on the benefits and who this therapy is for.\\n\\nBook your session at\\nwww.seomrasalainn.com\\n\\nTo get a better understanding of what we do you can DM us, check out www.seomrasalainn.com, Complete our Website enquiry form,\\nemail us at info\\u0040seomrasalainn.com\\nOr\\nCall 0861081238, we look forward to hearing from you!\\n\\n#pressotherapy, #lymphaticdrainage, #bodycontouring, #DetoxTreatment #SeomraSalainnWellnessCentre #adult #children #hayfever # performance # sinusitis #dublin #allergicrhinitis #allergies #relief #sports #wheezing #cough #chestinfection #COPD #salttherapy #eczema #acne #inflammation #antiaging #redlighttherapy #fibrosis #bonehealth #pain #musclerepair #infrared #oxygentherapy\"},\"cta_type\":\"VIEW_INSTAGRAM_PROFILE\",\"display_format\":\"IMAGE\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"http://instagram.com/seomrasalainnwellnesscentre\",\"images\":[{\"image_crops\":[],\"original_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/691127207_2191110054994436_2704151911443276383_n.jpg?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=XJVnv2Z9ZaIQ7kNvwEVxpGA&_nc_oc=AdpT6M90aGcyE9rwCkiGTJjHp-ucWoUXS8qDEnKH7CdDf37k9QOeHvad7Vg8OVnh_i6GKslwLVqqHD6zopExOwmC&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=WMJpnBc_Ba85Rm55aQroMQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af407TbqANhshLkWIZ7tF7Sd-5SDWLbUB8igVFXFKozbUA&oe=6A068D04\",\"resized_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/690650425_1298025308424808_6933564020610140745_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=wHRl2bzYbUcQ7kNvwEK1J58&_nc_oc=AdqpnvKbu2BeBF3HtCVp3XNWwSXEdG-uPAbK57EK7PQlOCKuuN4Is2gHkDoEUdTsDOfwwYY0QrfFAa3DLgXvPakc&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=WMJpnBc_Ba85Rm55aQroMQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af7mPynTZGH1phen94lHGgAS6qpy0R-kZh2plnF3O1-68g&oe=6A066B91\",\"watermarked_resized_image_url\":\"\"}],\"page_categories\":[\"Profile\"],\"page_like_count\":0,\"title\":null,\"videos\":[],\"is_reshared\":false,\"extra_links\":[],\"extra_texts\":[],\"extra_images\":[],\"extra_videos\":[],\"country_iso_code\":null,\"brazil_tax_id\":null,\"additional_info\":null,\"ec_certificates\":[]},\"is_active\":true,\"has_user_reported\":false,\"report_count\":null,\"menu_items\":[],\"state_media_run_label\":null,\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_name\":\"seomrasalainnwellnesscentre\",\"impressions_with_index\":{\"impressions_text\":null,\"impressions_index\":-1},\"gated_type\":\"ELIGIBLE\",\"categories\":[\"UNKNOWN\"],\"is_aaa_eligible\":true,\"contains_digital_created_media\":false,\"reach_estimate\":null,\"currency\":\"\",\"spend\":null,\"end_date\":1778396400,\"publisher_platform\":[\"INSTAGRAM\"],\"start_date\":1778050800,\"contains_sensitive_content\":false,\"total_active_time\":null,\"regional_regulation_data\":{\"finserv\":{\"is_deemed_finserv\":false,\"is_limited_delivery\":false},\"tw_anti_scam\":{\"is_limited_delivery\":false}},\"hide_data_status\":\"NONE\",\"fev_info\":null,\"ad_id\":null,\"targeted_or_reached_countries\":[]}],\"__typename\":\"CollatedSearchResults\"},\"cursor\":null},{\"node\":{\"collated_results\":[{\"ad_archive_id\":\"2200075064113457\",\"collation_count\":2,\"collation_id\":\"1311606613510251\",\"page_id\":\"103614551428466\",\"snapshot\":{\"branded_content\":{\"page_id\":\"103614551428466\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/megelinofficial/\",\"page_name\":\"Megelin\"},\"page_id\":\"377595312704579\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/bbbsarah/\",\"root_reshared_post\":null,\"byline\":\"\",\"disclaimer_label\":null,\"page_name\":\"Sarah Gearino, Healthy Life Balance\",\"page_profile_picture_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/683908096_1333054552208386_7332107070958014963_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=5CeOq4rK9g8Q7kNvwEexA8K&_nc_oc=Adoz9DZPZoy6OXfc5ozuotQAkLWIfXPHwIbLD6Dyv1hGy7m3NYwT8W2c-0AQrSovaAf_RiFQx0TLss-UxCl8yo6W&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=WMJpnBc_Ba85Rm55aQroMQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af4Rb7dv7c4dKHApiJeCUGCHIVHq3sqTT82StLQjnsnK0w&oe=6A068169\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"megelin.com\",\"cta_text\":\"Shop now\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"Neck and shoulder tension isn\\u2019t just from stress\\u2026 it\\u2019s from shifting hormones.\\n\\nAs estrogen starts to decline in perimenopause and beyond, blood flow decreases, muscles tighten, and inflammation rises, especially in the upper body. That\\u2019s why so many women over 40 wake up with stiffness, headaches, or constant tension through the traps and neck.\\n\\nI started using this Laser Lux Wrap 3\\u20134 times per week for just 15 minutes, and the difference has been incredible.\\n\\nHere\\u2019s why it works so well for women 40+:\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udca1 Red + Near Infrared Light Therapy boosts circulation, delivering oxygen and nutrients back to fatigued muscles.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udca1 Cellular ATP production increases \\u2014 helping your body naturally repair and regenerate tissue.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udca1 Inflammation decreases by targeting the root cause, not just masking pain.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udca1 Collagen synthesis improves, supporting connective tissue and joint flexibility as estrogen declines.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udca1 Nerve function and relaxation improve, easing that \\u201ctight band\\u201d feeling so many of us carry daily.\\n\\nIt\\u2019s become part of my weekly wellness routine, right up there with sleep, lifting, and recovery nutrition.\\n\\nBecause you can\\u2019t feel strong if you\\u2019re constantly in pain.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udca5Drop \\u201cWRAP\\u201d below  and I\\u2019ll send you details.\"},\"cta_type\":\"SHOP_NOW\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"https://megelin.com/products/megelin-wraplux-laser-led-wear-for-neck-shoulder\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"\\u6559\\u7ec3\"],\"page_like_count\":151075,\"title\":null,\"videos\":[{\"video_hd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMKiB0ewzsWIqs9Tzo_4rfikFfawy7X9sRczFxo-7AHGKFefUYdUEcB1r7-7s010OVr2F5lPSl6ouePpOmsHpHRpsf0CJFB5kLMu8o.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdoB1jNXB87AvEY_e0u9HM4HQDpIvyKMoYifhIQgkdhVeztUKK53HZwfteO8Vq4R6doks75kDCKh02Sb0yPGv3x6&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=BhbCNWCIYswQ7kNvwEZw3kb&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6Njc5MDEwNDY4MTk5NjY2LCJhc3NldF9hZ2VfZGF5cyI6MTk4LCJ2aV91c2V