ation rises, especially in the upper body. That\\u2019s why so many women over 40 wake up with stiffness, headaches, or constant tension through the traps and neck.\\n\\nI started using this Laser Lux Wrap 3\\u20134 times per week for just 15 minutes, and the difference has been incredible.\\n\\nHere\\u2019s why it works so well for women 40+:\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udca1 Red + Near Infrared Light Therapy boosts circulation, delivering oxygen and nutrients back to fatigued muscles.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udca1 Cellular ATP production increases \\u2014 helping your body naturally repair and regenerate tissue.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udca1 Inflammation decreases by targeting the root cause, not just masking pain.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udca1 Collagen synthesis improves, supporting connective tissue and joint flexibility as estrogen declines.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udca1 Nerve function and relaxation improve, easing that \\u201ctight band\\u201d feeling so many of us carry daily.\\n\\nIt\\u2019s become part of my weekly wellness routine, right up there with sleep, lifting, and recovery nutrition.\\n\\nBecause you can\\u2019t feel strong if you\\u2019re constantly in pain.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udca5Drop \\u201cWRAP\\u201d below  and I\\u2019ll send you details.\"},\"cta_type\":\"SHOP_NOW\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"https://megelin.com/products/megelin-wraplux-laser-led-wear-for-neck-shoulder\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"\\u6559\\u7ec3\"],\"page_like_count\":151075,\"title\":null,\"videos\":[{\"video_hd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMKiB0ewzsWIqs9Tzo_4rfikFfawy7X9sRczFxo-7AHGKFefUYdUEcB1r7-7s010OVr2F5lPSl6ouePpOmsHpHRpsf0CJFB5kLMu8o.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdoB1jNXB87AvEY_e0u9HM4HQDpIvyKMoYifhIQgkdhVeztUKK53HZwfteO8Vq4R6doks75kDCKh02Sb0yPGv3x6&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=BhbCNWCIYswQ7kNvwEZw3kb&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92