tisol \\u2014 and you\\u2019ve tried every supplement, every app, every meditation playlist, and nothing actually sticks.\\nThat\\u2019s because stress doesn\\u2019t just live in your head. It lives in your cells, your nervous system, your biofield. And until you address it at that level, nothing changes.\\n\\nThe One is a wearable biotuning device that heals your body from the inside out:\\n\\nInfrared Light Therapy \\u2014 repairs cells, reduces inflammation, enhances mitochondrial function\\nSolfeggio Sound Therapy \\u2014 recalibrates your nervous system for mental clarity and emotional balance\\nVibrating Crystals \\u2014 shungite & quartz in a copper casing for grounding and EMF protection\\n\\nIt looks like jewelry. It works like a reset button for your entire system.\"},\"cta_type\":\"ORDER_NOW\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"http://theonedevice.com/\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Health & wellness website\"],\"page_like_count\":5422,\"title\":\"Reset Your Nervous System. Just Wear It.\",\"videos\":[{\"video_hd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQMrLYi7Wkz0j6V-BbE7fh2cyvtnLp8p_0EcCmz5WT6JusdbJC-SPEff2lepoSlHgRkvXtxyy2qQSoXhnUuGDRSvieQ3jVNllYiwNzwBYoYj2Q.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=AdpfMkSBEiXMYK87roHdSc7-0SYjvJdZNDgE6T_2dAgP_9e9kejplC4CwvTrCBQrcoH-mNoTnq7sgH_fDWASdthn&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=nhbknGw_aSIQ7kNvwHyX_ot&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHAiLCJ4cHZfYXNzZXRfaWQiOjM1NzkyNjg3MTU1NTcyMjIsImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjoxNCwidmlfdXNlY2FzZV9pZCI6MTA3OTksImR1cmF0aW9uX3MiOjcwLCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0\\u00253D&ccb=17-1&vs=4885518cbc55d720&_nc_&_nc_gid=WMJpnBc_Ba85Rm55aQroMQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_Af75kcJEDJA-cwmbKPrPJ7MrgckHg8B8KVEQ1rIOuzU4Sg&oe=6A068968\",\"video_preview_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/680090144_8181278213548