e_name\":\"Swirise Global\",\"impressions_with_index\":{\"impressions_text\":null,\"impressions_index\":-1},\"gated_type\":\"ELIGIBLE\",\"categories\":[\"UNKNOWN\"],\"is_aaa_eligible\":true,\"contains_digital_created_media\":false,\"reach_estimate\":null,\"currency\":\"\",\"spend\":null,\"end_date\":1778396400,\"publisher_platform\":[\"FACEBOOK\",\"INSTAGRAM\",\"AUDIENCE_NETWORK\",\"MESSENGER\",\"THREADS\"],\"start_date\":1778137200,\"contains_sensitive_content\":false,\"total_active_time\":null,\"regional_regulation_data\":{\"finserv\":{\"is_deemed_finserv\":false,\"is_limited_delivery\":false},\"tw_anti_scam\":{\"is_limited_delivery\":false}},\"hide_data_status\":\"NONE\",\"fev_info\":null,\"ad_id\":null,\"targeted_or_reached_countries\":[]}],\"__typename\":\"CollatedSearchResults\"},\"cursor\":null},{\"node\":{\"collated_results\":[{\"ad_archive_id\":\"944000275041874\",\"collation_count\":1,\"collation_id\":\"1744585256912436\",\"page_id\":\"343534518849003\",\"snapshot\":{\"branded_content\":null,\"page_id\":\"343534518849003\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/61562061955567/\",\"root_reshared_post\":null,\"byline\":\"\",\"disclaimer_label\":null,\"page_name\":\"Irries\",\"page_profile_picture_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/671045987_984915770867772_904826199878773722_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=bnouvadiYPEQ7kNvwHNqMpO&_nc_oc=Adp81Rqoqx_Sj8vlATCt72hDyA4P-5Kj5-MckKPhEgssza9Q6N1KMKsOoWrKTcTnl8fdkcjAJHoNL8Vw1zpOkRTs&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna&_nc_gid=WMJpnBc_Ba85Rm55aQroMQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af7qTqGmVZqogn-ln3F67kqYLV9lZRwzSQnnoiDkZRru4Q&oe=6A068162\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"irries.com\",\"cta_text\":\"Shop now\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"\\ud83d\\udea8 Sciatica? Here's why surgery doesn't actually fix it \\u2014 and what people are doing instead\\u2026 \\u274c\\n\\nEnd sciatic pain with the groundbreaking new Uni Fusion Technology.\\n\\nYour disc is the foundation of your movement \\u2014 but when the pain keeps coming back no matter what you try, it can feel like your body is broken beyond repair\\u2026\\nIgnore it too long, and the damage only gets worse.\\n\\nBut before you try anything else \\u2014 there's something most doctors aren't telling you.\\n\\nEvery treatment out there targets the pressure on your nerve.\\n\\nSurgery. Injections. PT. They all do the same thing \\u2014 reduce the pressure temporarily.\\n\\nBut none of them heal the disc.\\n\\nAnd an unhealed disc? It can keep pressing on that nerve. Over and over again.\\n\\nThat's not bad luck. That's an incomplete fix.\\n\\nHere's what the research actually shows.\\n\\nA process called \\\"spontaneous disc resorption\\\" allows your herniated disc to retract away from the nerve and heal naturally \\u2014 but only when given the right environment to do it.\\nNothing you've tried has created that environment.\\n\\nUntil now.\\n\\nIntroducing the Irries \\\"Uni Fusion\\\" Belt \\u2014 the first device that activates your disc's natural healing ability in just 20 minutes a day.\\n\\nThis breakthrough device combines four clinically backed therapies to target your sciatica at the source:\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udc49 Mechanical Decompression\\n\\ud83d\\udc49 Soothing Heat Therapy\\n\\ud83d\\udc49 BiWave Light Therapy (Near-Infrared + Red Light)\\n\\ud83d\\udc49 Deep Tissue Massage\\n\\nJust 20 minutes a day from the comfort of your home can make a huge difference.\\n\\nUsers report significant relief in as little as 2\\u20133 weeks of daily use\\u2026\\n\\nReady to finally get your life back?\\n\\nTry the Irries \\\"Uni Fusion\\\" Belt completely risk-free today:\\n\\n\\u2705 Addresses the real reason everything failed\\n\\u2705 No surgery required\\n\\u2705 4 therapies in 1 device\\n\\u2705 Use it from home in 20 min a day\\n\\u2705 Backed by Dr. Blane Schilling\\n\\u2705 60-Results or Money Back Guarantee\\n\\u2705 FREE Shipping\\n\\nD