red differently.\\n\\nHyperbaric Oxygen Therapy increases oxygen availability throughout the body,\\nsupporting natural repair, circulation, and cellular energy.\\n\\nThe result?\\n\\u2013 More efficient recovery\\n\\u2013 Reduced inflammation\\n\\u2013 Improved overall wellbeing\\nConsistency is where the real shift happens.\\n\\nTAILORED PROTOCOLS\\nDesigned around your body, your pace, and your goals.\\nBecause real results come from the right approach .\\nAnd a protocol tailored for you.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udd34For an enhanced effect, sessions can be combined with red & near-infrared light therapy \\u2014 supporting cellular energy and recovery at a deeper level\\ud83d\\udd34\\n\\nCONSISTENCY CREATES CHANGE\\u2714\\ufe0f\\nHBOT works cumulatively \\u2014\\nsupporting oxygen delivery, repair, and cellular energy over time.\\n\\nOxygen Cove\\nCork city centre\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udccd 5 Father Mathew Street, Cork\\n\\ud83d\\udce9 DM to learn more or book\\n\\ud83c\\udf3fWhats-app 087-143 2445\"},\"cta_type\":\"INSTAGRAM_MESSAGE\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"http://instagram.com/oxygencovecork\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Health/beauty\"],\"page_like_count\":37,\"title\":null,\"videos\":[{\"video_hd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m367/AQM52bmIiQ4NIgCTTCujKJGkaOoNfCEdLD9iTBnK190Up7_PV9VBmJ5KpLFUcS9A65jxgQoWRGbTH1yOyNMt-hutWbF-LFSUjwFml9x-hQ.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=Ado6ul2l0UkC7p5tIw46_Kn_U46ioyDPMwf7D73XWYMX3-PjJuk8z9F9YuQvu2eHAlP4s2brJWroeWODCHGaViEV&_nc_sid=8bf8fe&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=te4db25ekacQ7kNvwGZwRKJ&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLnByb2dyZXNzaXZlX2gyNjQtYmFzaWMtZ2VuMl83MjBwIiwieHB2X2Fzc2V0X2lkIjoxOTI1NjA2MzE0Nzc4NTQyLCJhc3NldF9hZ2VfZGF5cyI6OCwidmlfdXNlY2FzZV9pZCI6MTAwOTksImR1cmF0aW9uX3MiOjEwLCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0\\u00253D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=WMJpnBc_Ba85Rm55aQroMQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_Af7rRElaPS