740\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/61588529031538/\",\"root_reshared_post\":null,\"byline\":\"\",\"disclaimer_label\":null,\"page_name\":\"Life After Back Pain\",\"page_profile_picture_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/679443075_2394523904377088_5660874317091297315_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=QcxEZxvlYgcQ7kNvwEHrptu&_nc_oc=Ado7bgwd8FunEnxikXf-h4JjYCnbBDydiFRwD7TYRb-yj0PzZNwOVRgzRsQM85ysw5ClJsXNYQ9SarPzAzfHyEb4&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna&_nc_gid=DYn9GJzeujERi96M2I5Tlw&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af5vAFgSmC4OULhB5Kje_V0kc0N5DhlIj9X_lEx8-0rRKQ&oe=6A0674FC\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"irries.com\",\"cta_text\":\"Shop now\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"\\ud83d\\udea8 Nurses with sciatica \\u2014 before you consider surgery, read this...\\n\\nYou've spent years lifting patients, working 12-hour shifts, and pushing through pain because that's what nurses do.\\n\\nBut now the sciatica is so bad you're wondering if you can even stay on the floor.\\n\\nEvery time you reposition a patient, pull someone up in bed, or bend forward to check a line \\u2014 that electric jolt shoots straight down your leg.\\n\\nYou've tried ibuprofen before every shift.\\n\\nGabapentin on the hard days.\\n\\nChiropractor. PT.\\n\\nMaybe even took time off hoping rest would fix it.\\n\\nNothing stuck.\\n\\nHere's what nobody told you \\u2014 not even in nursing school:\\n\\nYour herniated disc can actually heal on its own.\\n\\nIt's called \\\"spontaneous disc resorption\\\" \\u2014 a natural process where the disc retracts away from the nerve by itself.\\n\\nThe reason it hasn't happened?\\n\\nYour disc needs the right environment to activate that process.\\n\\nAnd nothing you've tried has created it.\\n\\nThat's exactly what the Irries \\\"Uni Fusion\\\" Belt was designed to do \\u2014 activate your disc's natural healing ability in just 20 minutes a day using 4 clinically-backed therapies working together:\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udc49 Mechanical Decompression\\n\\ud83d\\udc49 Soothing Heat Therapy\\n\\ud83d\\udc49 BiWave Light Therapy (Near-Infrared + Red Light)\\n\\ud83d\\udc49 Deep Tissue Massage\\n\\nThey told you in nursing school that up to 90\\u0025 of nurses develop chronic back pain.\\n\\nBut they never told you there was a way out that didn't involve surgery.\\n\\nUsers are reporting significant relief in as little as 2\\u20133 weeks of daily use.\\n\\nTry the Irries \\\"Uni Fusion\\\" Belt completely risk-free today:\\n\\n\\u2705 Designed to address the real reason everything else failed\\n\\u2705 4 therapies in 1 device\\n\\u2705 Use it from home in 20 min a day\\n\\u2705 Backed by Dr. Blane Schilling\\n\\u2705 60-Day Results or Money Back Guarantee\\n\\u2705 FREE Shipping\\n\\nDon't let sciatica end the career you've spent years building.\\n\\nTry it risk-free today \\u2014 52\\u0025 off for a limited time.\\n\\nLearn more: irries.com/m-iufb-adv-st-1\"},\"cta_type\":\"SHOP_NOW\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"https://irries.com/m-iufb-adv-st-1\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Medical Service\"],\"page_like_count\":1475,\"title\":\"Why nurses with sciatica are trying this before surgery...\",\"videos\":[{\"video_hd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQMAaY87tkG46qzRtEB4dzq_K_acABfdW0HDFb4d5ePVMAqH006w09FBiorc796u22az2NR1PKHThUz6h7UXuWoEXhE6Cs24I5YPU_Ze6jRxkQ.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdrOLwPtzJyhxDqERiN7deyiXPG4_dHrXl3AdRydBbiwGDh3GFrUDT4wxBc6ksNh6XA7FPfwF15IQ6s8c30WxqV6&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=fYJaf3UfE6sQ7kNvwGFa21C&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHAiLCJ4cHZfYXNzZXRfaWQiOjMxOTA1NzI1NDQ1NTU4MjYsImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjoxMiwidmlfdXNlY2FzZV9pZCI6MTA3OTksImR1cmF0aW9uX3MiOjUwNiwidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&vs=c9e32ed10a0b5d66&_nc_vs=HB