null,\"targeted_or_reached_countries\":[]}],\"__typename\":\"CollatedSearchResults\"},\"cursor\":null},{\"node\":{\"collated_results\":[{\"ad_archive_id\":\"26593641703588611\",\"collation_count\":1,\"collation_id\":\"1114987065023745\",\"page_id\":\"864840870048453\",\"snapshot\":{\"branded_content\":null,\"page_id\":\"864840870048453\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/61582674766771/\",\"root_reshared_post\":null,\"byline\":null,\"disclaimer_label\":null,\"page_name\":\"Optimal Health at Inspire\",\"page_profile_picture_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/670993706_26262970316735620_3690288319759371858_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=8exKzZ03y8YQ7kNvwF0aFNZ&_nc_oc=AdqkjLWEfoPrSDB-v2CrMkqKZCQWB3rspiRmd6lzDMDrInNAsy68dEqcPI18JXrJdoLc91KaX_7GFisAQ1Ai_nCn&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna&_nc_gid=DYn9GJzeujERi96M2I5Tlw&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af6iZev_D0vtnIlZA3gxpCvlDk_DoKpx6h32y9wNp4Mk6g&oe=6A067BDB\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"fb.me\",\"cta_text\":\"Sign up\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"Most people think of light as something that just hits the surface \\u2014 but at Optimal Health & Recovery at Inspire, located in Clonmel, Co. Tipperary, we use it as a powerful medical tool to fuel healing from the inside out.\\n\\nWatch our latest walkthrough to see how our dual-action Infrared system works:\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udd34 Red Light (Surface Level): This wavelength hits the skin to boost collagen production. Incredibly effective for smoothing fine lines, clearing acne, and improving overall skin tone.\\n\\n\\u2728 Near-Infrared (Deep Tissue): This penetrates deep into your muscles and tissues to stimulate the mitochondria \\u2014 your cellular power plants. By producing more ATP (cellular energy), your body can repair itself faster than ever before.\\n\\nWe use this technology across three main pillars of health:\\n\\nSkin Health: Target fine lines, acne, and uneven skin tone for a rejuvenated appearance.\\n\\nPain Management: Effectively manage the discomfort of arthritis and persistent back pain by cooling inflammation at the source.\\n\\nMuscle Recovery: Speed up recovery after intense training sessions by flushing out lactic acid and repairing micro-tears in record time.\\n\\nThe best part? This treatment is entirely non-invasive, pain-free, and backed by clinical science. You simply lie back and let the light do the work.\\n\\nSo if you're struggling with a chronic condition \\u2014 don't settle for just managing the symptoms. It's time to fuel your repair at a cellular level.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udc49 Click the link below to find out more about Advanced Infrared Therapy at Optimal Health & Recovery at Inspire.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udccd Unit 12m, Ard Gaoithe Business Park, Clonmel \\u2014 \\ud83d\\udcde 083 867 2844\"},\"cta_type\":\"SIGN_UP\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":\"Infrared Therapy\",\"link_url\":\"http://fb.me/\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Health & wellness website\"],\"page_like_count\":1100,\"title\":\"From Acne to Arthritis: Clinical Recovery with Infrared Therapy\",\"videos\":[{\"video_hd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQPtaLUoxy669Uhd3EpsdcrPX4iky4Qgg7zzjLjkI3k6Bw00gKuPrCRWzO8R7qtrLpWvWMusHa936M54qk2BYzvZTdWY8fyotcGyULY.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Adob_-zbf5P9oZn7TX9_fl_ZukK6OE4LqKz7XDEJAdjWsDQyoCFgCyovJAY7XV5POgx7D8I75pM9khkepiEADARA&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=dCgrf6gyLtAQ7kNvwEWOEQg&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTc4NjAxNzk1Mjg1ODk4OTUsImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjoxMTAsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMDk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjo1OSwidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&vs=2adf0f90276d7948&_nc_--5PxUCKAJDMywXQE3VP3ztkWgYEmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MREAdQBl5p0BAA&_nc_gid=DYn9GJzeujERi96M2I5Tlw&_nc_ss=7b2a8&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_Af7chVzagpxdgnb-2ttgjub1