null,\"video_sd_url\":null,\"watermarked_video_hd_url\":null,\"watermarked_video_sd_url\":null,\"image_crops\":[],\"original_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/686945695_1637975883947643_8030360171597240330_n.jpg?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=U659D4nTHCAQ7kNvwECiBmS&_nc_oc=AdorVOVh26A3lxy0m4lyn1EYafHr3GAdOkJylPiAJqJm7goW4NkpF_fcDMUO4ylJsoJ9YOYhtKDXWr_TEMqnLpLC&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=DYn9GJzeujERi96M2I5Tlw&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af740kzawOwc0Jm2TPak9-9mxeUHCH0hmubU4r5xYY5BRQ&oe=6A067B46\",\"resized_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/689894881_1452299372891575_8103724892542121892_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=1Txk9zRPJtUQ7kNvwF3SjDr&_nc_oc=Adr80IlOQ_J3rSgTOSDytJ8j5qhyVQadwnOfgMXxjd3Q6nG3IRdsuwD1VoBFf2-x3VhlJjULMEFyRkd9_QYhV-im&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=DYn9GJzeujERi96M2I5Tlw&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af7JTECvuwGtDXo641yMebM7uAnBLboGX3sE79scSfB4ZA&oe=6A067AC5\",\"watermarked_resized_image_url\":\"\"}],\"body\":{\"text\":\"What is actually happening?\\n\\nRed and near-infrared light penetrate the skin and reach your cells\\u2014particularly the mitochondria, which are responsible for producing energy (ATP).\\n\\nWhen exposed to specific wavelengths:\\n\\n* Mitochondria become more efficient\\n* Cellular energy production increases\\n* Oxidative stress can decrease\\n* Blood flow and oxygen delivery improve\\n\\nThis is why many clinicians see it as a foundational support therapy, not a standalone solution.\"},\"cta_type\":\"VIEW_INSTAGRAM_PROFILE\",\"display_format\":\"CAROUSEL\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"http://instagram.com/cellularinstitute\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Health & wellness website\"],\"page_like_count\":287,\"title\":\"cellular Institute \",\"videos\":[],\"is_reshared\":false,\"extra_links\":[],\"extra_texts\":[],\"extra_images\":[],\"extra_videos\":[],\"country_iso_code\":null,