s the SYMBYX PDCare infrared laser, can be a helpful complementary therapy to manage your Parkinson\\u2019s symptoms, with benefits persisting up to 5 years (1).\\n\\nLive life more fully, knowing your symptoms are at bay \\ud83d\\udcaa\\n\\nClick here to order yours!\\nwww.symbyxbiome.com/products/symbyx-pdcare-green\\n\\nAlways follow the directions of use. \\n\\nLiebert, A., Bicknell, B., Laakso, EL. et al. Improvements in clinical signs and symptoms of Parkinson\\u2019s disease using photobiomodulation: a five-year follow-up. BMC Neurol 24, 381 (2024). https://doi.org/10.1186/s12883-024-03857-z\\n\\n========\\nThe SYMBYX PDCare is CE and ARTG listed as a complementary therapy for the reduction of Parkinson\\u2019s symptoms. SYMBYX devices are subject to different regulations, permits and clearances in each country.\"},\"cta_type\":\"SHOP_NOW\",\"display_format\":\"IMAGE\",\"link_description\":\"Laser light therapy device for the reduction of Parkinson's symptoms (CE/ARTG listed). Painless & suitable for home use. Explore the SYMBYX PDCare Laser now.\",\"link_url\":\"https://symbyxbiome.com/products/symbyx-pdcare-green\",\"images\":[{\"image_crops\":[],\"original_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/656391856_922842930491464_5147020758873748071_n.jpg?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=elATKQV9_mcQ7kNvwEtCqP3&_nc_oc=AdqRubcLoNrrvq28kdYZeBJdD29P6xwRiG-DibhQThUp-SEMpzjnv8T9uoTZjuGGdZg6lZy3rF8cTUhvYRU9qRIh&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=ruwhb5-fBE7aW_1pM4I7Tg&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af7Ju6mfsEzUkiWLUBqm6u6YvCz3Wh73N6gkVKg-uxTltQ&oe=6A065D84\",\"resized_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/658138730_966324052605414_6094494326092907357_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=L0TIBU1PYaQQ7kNvwH7vX1x&_nc_oc=Adpx6dfmbi0m0EFCITGonCVf87p6fHPWTcW1k3LvepHidYs_qxC2B5wSBSw6lz_HgETNrYjr5OQ9r7w27Oqa7pvb&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=ruwhb5-fBE7aW_1pM4I7T