t=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=h8-gySpe7qwQ7kNvwE392ne&_nc_oc=AdplM0T9eOG03hE7zZcLl4UO0wHr_Y8rilBWLbzErEjlyWN2h_4LNy_yG1es2tw-vJqNyNsJHFsseF6Zd1OO9xqs&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=ruwhb5-fBE7aW_1pM4I7Tg&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af4O8LDdftE3tv_aQSlrX7WGpJBeEb4Tl-E6guEqRN7b2g&oe=6A067BF6\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"symbyxbiome.com\",\"cta_text\":\"Shop now\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"Looking for something to assist with energy levels and mental acuity? \\ud83e\\udde0\\n\\nMeet the SYMBYX Neuro, our iconic infrared and red-light wellness device.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udd2c Inspired by 20+ years of research, this Australian-designed helmet is meticulously crafted to support brain health, boost energy levels, and improve cognitive function. \\ud83d\\udca1\\n\\nThis easy, no-fuss therapy is trusted by families around the world who want their loved ones to feel good and stay sharp. \\u26a1\\n\\nSupport the people who have supported you. \\nLearn more on our website.\"},\"cta_type\":\"SHOP_NOW\",\"display_format\":\"IMAGE\",\"link_description\":\"Support clarity, energy and focus in just minutes a day\",\"link_url\":\"https://symbyxbiome.com/products/symbyx-neuro\",\"images\":[{\"image_crops\":[],\"original_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/656459314_821126030359591_5799492371430641398_n.jpg?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=wh4OfSRl6OcQ7kNvwEdB-Ti&_nc_oc=AdpWXXRYEEOz-VePvx0K4ilkXBE_SQ7JaNYOXcQKKDS755kcpnb6wwBaaAaZAGlvSms0lvky1aa1lTTkwVMYLh4N&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna&_nc_gid=ruwhb5-fBE7aW_1pM4I7Tg&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af6oH3hnMilgFCHUndtO1coLNdfrZU0Z4WR-dAYBsRofAw&oe=6A068926\",\"resized_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/655052530_902943605879032_6293256921252564241_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=9kvK9eL-xd0Q7kNvwHk1ze3&_nc_oc=AdqPVyqzAGxwkBt3A3bzEewpOmHl8-s2kW-s6NpcLarj14NNMtJqkBy3f7eUB8scUyniJYs1HGeSeeo8k758QZod&_nc_zt=14&_nc