"symbyxbiome.com\",\"link_description\":\"Light therapy for Parkinson's\",\"link_url\":\"https://symbyxbiome.com/products/symbyx-pdcare-green\",\"title\":\"Regain Independence\",\"cta_text\":\"Shop Now\",\"video_hd_url\":null,\"video_preview_image_url\":null,\"video_sd_url\":null,\"watermarked_video_hd_url\":null,\"watermarked_video_sd_url\":null,\"image_crops\":[{\"image_crops\":[{\"image_crop\":[531,79]},{\"image_crop\":[1818,1366]}],\"image_size\":\"DIM_100_100\"}],\"original_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/655456771_3478008575685264_7954850864282440882_n.jpg?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=KjO7dJUmNXcQ7kNvwFQ8a8s&_nc_oc=AdpdSpcRgqBSUY0J2RpObdNjcwGzGBsU8yEjI36OTYRTLrOBZX7FM_ST8-U0JmTf6hQKVYEQi9t_Q0PZriyz9u0l&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=ruwhb5-fBE7aW_1pM4I7Tg&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af60m8hOHANBHB8kvzVWR790cidcESgmsV5gZi39ynOW_w&oe=6A067C04\",\"resized_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/656183707_964381849602233_7974150776180859242_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=C5kFg8B7bxkQ7kNvwEAj4KO&_nc_oc=AdoCy4I4TW45fnUo3euSIqE-R4mDit0paVlgGjeLz5TikM1LWpIEijSLdQVuyUggeIWUdcbpxARZXpbcEmNklbsg&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=ruwhb5-fBE7aW_1pM4I7Tg&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af5-ug4BvSPcbBfxgskksapkkrtjs2h4H8VMbYJCmRccsA&oe=6A065F54\",\"watermarked_resized_image_url\":\"\"}],\"body\":{\"text\":\"Are you looking for a non-invasive way to help a family member manage their Parkinson's symptoms? \\ud83e\\udde0\\n\\n\\ud83e\\uddd1\\u200d\\u2695\\ufe0f Clinical trial data suggests light therapy, such as the SYMBYX PDCare infrared laser, can be a helpful complementary therapy to manage Parkinson\\u2019s symptoms. \\n\\n\\ud83d\\udcc8 Benefits can last up to 5 years (1).\\n\\nSYMBYX devices are easy-to use and designed for the home. \\ud83c\\udfe0\\n\\nClick here to learn more: symbyxbiome.com/products/symbyx-pdcare-green\\n\\nAlways follow the directions of use.\\n\\nLiebert, A., Bicknell, B., Laakso, EL. et al. Improvements in clinical signs and symptoms of Parkinson\\u2019s disease using photobiomodulation: a five-year follow-up. BMC Neurol 24, 381 (2024). https://doi.org/10.1186/s12883-024-03857-z\\n\\n========\\nThe SYMBYX PDCare is MDD-compliant and ARTG listed as a complementary therapy for the reduction of Parkinson\\u2019s symptoms. SYMBYX devices are subject to different regulations, permits and clearances in each country.\"},\"cta_type\":\"SHOP_NOW\",\"display_format\":\"CAROUSEL\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"https://symbyxbiome.com/products/symbyx-pdcare-green\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Medical Service\"],\"page_like_count\":9923,\"title\":\"Symbyx Biome\",\"videos\":[],\"is_reshared\":false,\"extra_links\":[],\"extra_texts\":[],\"extra_images\":[],\"extra_videos\":[],\"country_iso_code\":null,\"brazil_tax_id\":null,\"additional_info\":null,\"ec_certificates\":[]},\"is_active\":true,\"has_user_reported\":false,\"report_count\":null,\"menu_items\":[],\"state_media_run_label\":null,\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_name\":\"Symbyx Biome\",\"impressions_with_index\":{\"impressions_text\":null,\"impressions_index\":-1},\"gated_type\":\"ELIGIBLE\",\"categories\":[\"UNKNOWN\"],\"is_aaa_eligible\":true,\"contains_digital_created_media\":false,\"reach_estimate\":null,\"currency\":\"\",\"spend\":null,\"end_date\":1778310000,\"publisher_platform\":[\"FACEBOOK\",\"INSTAGRAM\",\"MESSENGER\"],\"start_date\":1774854000,\"contains_sensitive_content\":false,\"total_active_time\":null,\"regional_regulation_data\":{\"finserv\":{\"is_deemed_finserv\":false,\"is_limited_delivery\":false},\"tw_anti_scam\":{\"is_limited_delivery\":false}},\"hide_data_status\":\"NONE\",\"fev_info\":null,\"ad_id\":null,\"targeted_or_reached_countries\":[]}],\"__typename\":\"CollatedSearchResults\"},\"cursor\":null},{\"node\":{\"collated_results\":[{\"ad_archive_id\":\"1309821211099037\",\"collation_count\":1,\"coll