          "content": {
            "size": 155222,
            "mimeType": "text/html",
            "text": "{\"data\":{\"ad_library_main\":{\"search_results_connection\":{\"edges\":[{\"node\":{\"collated_results\":[{\"ad_archive_id\":\"3560330264120917\",\"collation_count\":1,\"collation_id\":\"1520031799511374\",\"page_id\":\"848769125163565\",\"snapshot\":{\"branded_content\":null,\"page_id\":\"848769125163565\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/thebeardstruggle/\",\"root_reshared_post\":null,\"byline\":null,\"disclaimer_label\":null,\"page_name\":\"The Beard Struggle\",\"page_profile_picture_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/686511102_1681475833043861_6616809350169028016_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=ecZa9vGhPFcQ7kNvwHCkjRC&_nc_oc=AdpYAGCOv3iz3L-weK40BSRGqFCZdjahxktRi5LrIE-WWs0YKlZY89zEXuIpZbQuOoMQuQqi7ghEJ-gDpqrNsQns&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna&_nc_gid=rkW1PeX5vPLZI9uVDNqd6Q&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af62cx-FOxIaQi9e0YrvkLsdh4eZDrd-lOZ0jSaz0Rp-Zw&oe=6A065C37\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"thebeardstruggle.com\",\"cta_text\":\"Shop now\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"Struggling with a beard that is coarse, uneven, frizzy, or impossible to control in the morning?\\n\\nYou are not alone. Most guys fight the same battle.\\nPatchy spots. Flyaways. Beard that never sits right.\\nAnd constant irritation every time you try to tame it.\\n\\nToday that changes.\\n\\nThe all new Carbon X Pro just launched with our best deal of the year, and it is already becoming a must have for men who want a cleaner, fuller looking, better behaving beard.\\n\\nIf the original CarbonX was good, Carbon X Pro is a different level. It is built to transform stubborn beards into smooth, sharp, controlled looks in minutes.\\n\\nUnlock the upgrade:\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udd34 Infrared Technology for healthier, stronger looking follicles\\n\\u26a1 5 in 1 performance for total beard domination\\n\\ud83e\\uddf2 Super fast magnetic charging\\n\\ud83d\\udd25 4 heat levels for every beard type\\n\\ud83d\\udcdf LED display for instant precision\\n\\ud83e\\uddd4\\u200d\\u2642\\ufe0f ION Tech for less frizz and more shine\\n\\nThe deal is live right now and will not last long.\\n\\nIf your beard has ever annoyed you, fought against you, or looked messy no matter what you try, this is your chance to fix it fast.\\n\\nUse Code: JJAY20 for 20\\u0025 Off\\n\\nShop Carbon X Pro while the offer is active.\"},\"cta_type\":\"SHOP_NOW\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"https://eu.thebeardstruggle.com/carbon-x-pro\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Website\",\"Health & Beauty\"],\"page_like_count\":458296,\"title\":\"Transform Your Beard in Minutes\",\"videos\":[{\"video_hd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQMoKW872CJJUdPL5uJ2e_ptb-u5xLsnSF-xHsO7Q73J8oe6U6b1KTUYon3ZQs5WKZDrSKaMrnQ203DCvNQdE8gt5C2rMpMPGwV1XESd3syz0Q.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=AdoKAkOq7YYpY40RfOkjV1yXUpanOj8tOLPmpvPEBmAJVktUP30qqWFDJ64uZHnTj9BIyfbKsIwwoRtFqVnZg9JB&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=PhIxUn1VdlUQ7kNvwF14Urd&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHAiLCJ4cHZfYXNzZXRfaWQiOjE2MTc4MTUzODI2MzQxNjQsImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjo0LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDEzOSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MjksInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ\\u00253D\\u00253D&ccb=17-1&vs=6533e8ae47012858&_nc_&_nc_gid=rkW1PeX5vPLZI9uVDNqd6Q&_nc_ss=7b2a8&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_Af7HoW37VnuSeQIcrICf_qLbMBMQED9manWxNIMhkL60gA&oe=6A067F00\",\"video_preview_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/687031154_868168846311410_4320007161979119389_n.jpg?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=6JC2k9d4mZ8Q7kNvwGwCiwY&_nc_oc=Adpqro9OZuTSkUC58nysMqw5D0RHajDY-DdNRUNJz9f9GNQaJk2RTcDPuCWFYh4Oqdcelw_D9ua2LBCTF6UdvMBQ&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=rkW1PeX5vPLZI9uVDNqd6Q&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af6jTBEa3kMy5Oj2f0lujULqpuG0t-1B2sL6Q0q_D-a-TQ&oe=6A06718D\