5BfTZHX-sHEhLjZGM7mWOcvpiHlpDjVObmi1NNZVmu4Q&oe=6A06851F\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"symbyxbiome.com\",\"cta_text\":\"Shop now\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"\\ud83d\\udd2c A recent clinical study suggests that the SYMBYX Neuro \\u2013 a light therapy wellness device, has the potential for individuals with Parkinson\\u2019s to improve their well-being (1).\\n\\nLearn more about the device here: \\nsymbyxbiome.com/products/symbyx-neuro\\n\\nDisclaimer: The SYMBYX Neuro is a wellness device and is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease, including Parkinson's Disease. This statement is based on preliminary findings from a recent clinical study and individual results may vary. Consult your healthcare provider before use.\"},\"cta_type\":\"SHOP_NOW\",\"display_format\":\"IMAGE\",\"link_description\":\"SYMBYX, an Australian medtech company developing light therapies for intractable conditions, today announced the results of a Sydney Adventist Hospital (commonly known as the San) triple-blinded, randomised controlled trial investigating the effects of a new red light therapy and infrared light ther...\",\"link_url\":\"https://symbyxbiome.com/blogs/symbyx-blog/symbyx-announces-promising-sydney-adventist-hospital-clinical-trial-results\",\"images\":[{\"image_crops\":[],\"original_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/656013811_26279627541699078_5865593084930698223_n.jpg?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=mivnpP1tTlwQ7kNvwG4XGiX&_nc_oc=AdoSm3u41kaiiNeguzbDOlrM_fmXaWbZOCEG9GOPVw9Zf4yd0VNXpDJRie5tJhOTn0x2L7HaJjiesKSyu_NJeSmJ&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=rkW1PeX5vPLZI9uVDNqd6Q&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af69crCXv5Nj0YdonK45tloUEigMk4MzNRgdRAkzjWvk2w&oe=6A065669\",\"resized_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/654756739_1470223091480574_609637929571627338_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=UpPpvxJmuPQQ7kNvwFoH6IP&_nc_oc=AdoVL0Gp4ppA3V3g