rt gum tissue at the source - right from home.\\n\\n\\u2705 Supports healthier gum structure\\n\\u2705 Helps calm irritation and sensitivity\\n\\u2705 Takes just 5 minutes a day\\n\\nLearn what\\u2019s really happening inside receding gums \\u2192 https://www.myhealray.com/dental-news-advertorial\"},\"cta_type\":\"LEARN_MORE\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"https://fb.com/canvas_doc/2546489272482642\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Cosmetic Dentist\"],\"page_like_count\":2610,\"title\":\"Try It Risk Free For 60 Days\",\"videos\":[{\"video_hd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQOqifGhkMWSYNfgeAO27zqdivwnpd5mw56OPfGzEAwQBttO_z5jJf854kjYK-LsniwvgsBxLuO1i3nAX2RHrzYIJ7OUQRWtBoNnYkpUuUpSPA.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Ado94yjJZAAmb-2LobguS3UQyGPAd1xviFN5OWhgr9NEMzNm6WceKGLbyLGzZXFliH41SrMGS7W4Q6a2c5rw900T&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=VHRPIAjr1PQQ7kNvwE6XcL5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHAiLCJ4cHZfYXNzZXRfaWQiOjE3MDU3MDgwMzM3Mjk4NTcsImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjoyMywidmlfdXNlY2FzZV9pZCI6MTA3OTksImR1cmF0aW9uX3MiOjc1LCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0\\u00253D&ccb=17-1&vs=dd48df6d0a8e306f&_nc_&_nc_gid=rkW1PeX5vPLZI9uVDNqd6Q&_nc_ss=7b2a8&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_Af5QqnQbEIK4y_gNnja4hlsbbLqdV4iM_I3kOiAwOaevzw&oe=6A068BEE\",\"video_preview_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/672682857_3200176236856039_7402785514234936247_n.jpg?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=jhTVDHsAKo4Q7kNvwG5VIcS&_nc_oc=AdptOe_LWbj9Xm3xtG_lHZBdxRyZGDeyUg77fXzJJnMr73AJ1X54Bg2jGap-bZL0yMTEK_S-gKUncpes7345skTW&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna&_nc_gid=rkW1PeX5vPLZI9uVDNqd6Q&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af6zetydkS6ZgRHKuI1VgzccPaVUlU4u75kl2FlFmqVn-A&oe=6A06738D\",\"video_sd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m412/AQP8v-ly1usKGg_RsdntCXBGV-fzsWQwjfvnHlTi6mCwnBpRSdWJzHdS8kzkKd_YGre3r_31BT