",\"page_profile_picture_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/684130890_1677965023230012_8676481258235246513_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=gGY3jgEI_AcQ7kNvwG-SpLE&_nc_oc=Adoa4PDGt6I9S4JORTESiclNP7b5lpfHcEy07AQegfwoCFfHXaGOk7Enzrexv1l-VY4ULBwr96mXVSNh21iS92QA&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=lBWwDr1hkgN6Af23qVEQvA&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af7CKGI_o98rSEjaMyRctihvFQTGLMeVt0NpHfM3YkwygA&oe=6A068933\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"rougecare.co.uk\",\"cta_text\":\"Shop now\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"G4 panels deliver red and near-infrared light using 8 targeted wavelengths, coverage up to 1060 nm, and strong measured irradiance.\\n\\nResearch on photobiomodulation suggests potential support for:\\n\\u2022 Skin health\\n\\u2022 Muscle recovery\\n\\u2022 Joint comfort\\n\\u2022 Cellular energy production\\n\\nSmart presets make daily sessions simple, so you can focus on your goals.\"},\"cta_type\":\"SHOP_NOW\",\"display_format\":\"IMAGE\",\"link_description\":\"Trusted by Health Professionals\",\"link_url\":\"https://rouge.care/en-uk/collections/rouge-g4-panels\",\"images\":[{\"image_crops\":[],\"original_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/686201670_1632208331407253_7408666369017835340_n.jpg?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=goTkbGw5ozYQ7kNvwEx6FND&_nc_oc=AdpZjYtSepc9IPA62XSFtkmNjXSFXtQwT0Drk4X6pqroPt26FjEDGYtty1XRcuENs6ikxwOEHqlnWyoZcp2a86HM&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=lBWwDr1hkgN6Af23qVEQvA&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af6DEcVPelpU0tbxuI2HRIBKyPLRYWNTq1I_Pir_sUbA9w&oe=6A067129\",\"resized_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/684876744_2375954252829888_1554065235635006019_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=RG8cqfqgdfIQ7kNvwGzoRve&_nc_oc=AdqRsajQRJoQgPAQRwoq6uD-jclQQSoRoy4HRYxXzZjvHo3oQAw6iwAxE2GhT96FWfKrLOxu24MsHJvwodHtwZny&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=lBWwDr1