          "content": {
            "size": 165474,
            "mimeType": "text/html",
            "text": "{\"data\":{\"ad_library_main\":{\"search_results_connection\":{\"edges\":[{\"node\":{\"collated_results\":[{\"ad_archive_id\":\"3373103552857115\",\"collation_count\":1,\"collation_id\":\"1877755396256098\",\"page_id\":\"864840870048453\",\"snapshot\":{\"branded_content\":null,\"page_id\":\"864840870048453\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/61582674766771/\",\"root_reshared_post\":null,\"byline\":null,\"disclaimer_label\":null,\"page_name\":\"Optimal Health at Inspire\",\"page_profile_picture_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/681333391_1740442947314698_6739976981385683521_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=WoPFkuGr_XUQ7kNvwF-eST3&_nc_oc=AdrjZJvkIqUEkSCXZZuA0Pk3ToZ0gxDs_2EitgpZt3PcnlnYLw0l-FP7Z3Yi8ds9Onm9r6uCrOlGyK8_bnNpYg4C&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=3RYrHKp-JWVepgQ1WrR1fQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af5H1rkec0WmpafQ20hIQwcO79KPTeQ2DP_QEDWEtk8qbA&oe=6A065EF7\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"fb.me\",\"cta_text\":\"Sign up\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"Paul drives an hour to come to us at Optimal Health & Recovery at Inspire in Clonmel. Every single time.\\n\\nSeven weeks ago, he walked in with chronic back pain following surgery. He had been reduced to 13 holes of golf before the pain forced him to stop. \\n\\nHe started a course of Advanced Infrared Therapy combined with specialist massage.\\n\\nThis past weekend he played 36 holes.\\n\\nOur Advanced Infrared Therapy works by penetrating up to three inches deep into the tissue \\u2014 reducing inflammation at the source, stimulating cellular repair, improving circulation, and accelerating the healing process that surgery alone leaves incomplete.\\n\\nOur specialist massage therapy does far more than relieve surface tension. It physically flushes the metabolic waste that accumulates around injury and surgical sites. It restores circulation and lymphatic drainage to the tissue that needs to repair. It releases the deep muscular tension that builds up around pain and restricts movement. And it works directly on the nervous system \\u2014 shifting the body out of the protective stress state it has been locked in and into the deep repair mode where recovery actually happens.\\n\\nThe combination of Advanced Infrared and specialist massage is one of the most complete clinical recovery protocols we offer. And the results speak for themselves.\\nLess pain. Better movement. Back to doing what you love.\\n\\nIrish Life and Laya Healthcare members may be able to claim back for massage therapy depending on their plan.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udc49 Click the link below to sign up for your session at Optimal Health & Recovery at Inspire, Clonmel.\"},\"cta_type\":\"SIGN_UP\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":\"Massage therapy at Optimal Health.\",\"link_url\":\"http://fb.me/\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Health & wellness website\"],\"page_like_count\":1100,\"title\":\"If You're Living With Post-Surgical Pain \\u2014 This is for you.\",\"videos\":[{\"video_hd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQMEcfedGyqSs2UrU8HMFuGOGJjDDBBj45AVE_uAMCFxKOPf3Z_7ghiQjlOdCxQj7N7kaJSxcl-k6tn7zMSajrSN30qef5D4xHsgeU83IBOGCw.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=AdpbwKyjtYhjCPtDKgj9blgknELrMZAx00TgxRLu1-5wvWxoGzkNBnR2rrCUMurnBnhpvnIw7q49jR82JyN3YSR0&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=WcTG_iiBargQ7kNvwGzKKCW&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHAiLCJ4cHZfYXNzZXRfaWQiOjE3MDU3MTMzMjcyNjkyMjEsImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjoxMiwidmlfdXNlY2FzZV9pZCI6MTA3OTksImR1cmF0aW9uX3MiOjY1LCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0\\u00253D&ccb=17-1&vs=4d30ec920071721c&_nc_vs=HBksFQIYRWZiX2VwaGVtZXJhbC8zMDQ1RDNGMkUwRkUzMTQzOUMwMkYyNkI2MThFOUZBMl9tdF8xX3ZpZGVvX2Rhc2hpbml0Lm1wNBUAAsgBEgAVAhhAZmJfcGVybWFuZW50LzBDNEIyODE2ODc5MDNENjQ1Q0Q1QjVGRkQ5MzJERDlEX2F1ZGlvX2Rhc2hpbml0Lm1wNBUCAsgBEgAoABgAGwKIB3VzZV9vaWwBMRJwcm9ncmVzc2l2ZV9yZWNpcGUBMRUAACbKla_PytWHBhUCKAJDMywXQFA90vGp--cYGWRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHARAHUAZd6oAQA&_nc_gid=3RYrHKp-JWVepgQ1WrR1fQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_Af4TsXg8L6JCPTHsIILJlVcn97flnkc_FRpcAZb5TmpiNg&oe=6A065A1B\",\"video_preview_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/681201811_1633112364574414_6919105197242682979_n.jpg?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=rTjovNUoTvUQ7kNvwGxQeeI&_nc_oc=AdoocEl9STdepNgE6l5YcDUfn28MPSrz5MZapVUR76ueYJ011fyr-qGFDpKwSEv6yQpd22VPwNGaeNqvlnTsAtEO&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna&_nc_gid=3RYrHKp-JWVepgQ1WrR1fQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af5uaZ1dfues9bE5HYEM2FqE-YDU1sas6hLkrdhrblj4zA&oe=6A065789\",\"video_sd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m412/AQOln8rEITYqWC7OYXY06YBZNWQpnKESHlRUkK_OCltzL228R23SgWfKYbAUAUafm3Dl0awrc2rK3gcTSCizeLvlMWAVVhvERYL6_T2iWQ.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdrEWfJHEnrOwhv4nAWawXDiiyCG_X-RmjLE69lx40E-HflOWVZPNGiEwmssnnxA253LuBuunbgSa3fqykYNHPGT&_nc_sid=8bf8fe&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=R9k9SljQWLcQ7kNvwEoEDGk&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuMzYwLnN2ZV9zZCIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTcwNTcxMzMyNzI2OTIyMSwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjEyLCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDc5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6NjUsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ\\u00253D\\u00253D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=3RYrHKp-JWVepgQ1WrR1fQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_Af4DU1RcB0jkZ49-EgroUivapdqRBAAO4UvGF3ZPX56kYA&oe=6A0682BD\",\"watermarked_video_hd_url\":null,\"watermarked_video_sd_url\":null}],\"is_reshared\":false,\"extra_links\":[\"http://www.optimalhealthatinspire.ie/\",\"https://www.optimalhealthatinspire.ie/privacy-policy\",\"http://www.optimalhealthatinspire.ie/\"],\"extra_texts\":[{\"text\":\"Feel Better in Everyday Life\"},{\"text\":\"Recovery & wellness protocols to help you feel better now \\u2014 and age well long term. With HBOT \\u2022 PEMF \\u2022 Infrared, we support energy, sleep, easier movement, and the habits that underpin longevity so you can stay active, strong, and sharp for years. \\n\\nShare a few details and we\\u2019ll line up a quick 5-minute call to chat about how we can help you.\"},{\"text\":\"Enter your details below and we'll be in touch.\"},{\"text\":\"Which treatment are you interested in?\"},{\"text\":\"Infrared Therapy\"},{\"text\":\"Hyperbaric Oxygen Therapy\"},{\"text\":\"PEMF Therapy\"},{\"text\":\"Massage Therapy\"},{\"text\":\"What town are you living?\"},{\"text\":\"Have you used these therapies before?\"},{\"text\":\"Do you have any medical conditions?\"},{\"text\":\"Full name\"},{\"text\":\"Email\"},{\"text\":\"Phone number\"},{\"text\":\"Terms and Conditions for Optimal Health at Inspire\"},{\"text\":\"Visit Optimal Health & Recovery at Inspire's Privacy Policy.\"},{\"text\":\"Thanks, we'll reach out as soon as possible.\"},{\"text\":\"You can visit our website or exit the form now.\"}],\"extra_images\":[],\"extra_videos\":[],\"country_iso_code\":null,\"brazil_tax_id\":null,\"additional_info\":null,\"ec_certificates\":[]},\"is_active\":true,\"has_user_reported\":false,\"report_count\":null,\"menu_items\":[],\"state_media_run_label\":null,\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_name\":\"Optimal Health at Inspire\",\"impressions_with_index\":{\"impressions_text\":null,\"impressions_index\":-1},\"gated_type\":\"ELIGIBLE\",\"categories\":[\"UNKNOWN\"],\"is_aaa_eligible\":true,\"contains_digital_created_media\":false,\"reach_estimate\":null,\"currency\":\"\",\"spend\":null,\"end_date\":1778310000,\"publisher_platform\":[\"FACEBOOK\",\"INSTAGRAM\",\"AUDIENCE_NETWORK\"],\"start_date\":1778137200,\"contains_sensitive_content\":false,\"total_active_time\":null,\"regional_regulation_data\":{\"finserv\":{\"is_deemed_finserv\":false,\"is_limited_delivery\":false},\"tw_anti_scam\":{\"is_limited_delivery\":false}},\"hide_data_status\":\"NONE\",\"fev_info\":null,\"ad_id\":null,\"targeted_or_reached_countries\":[]}],\"__typename\":\"CollatedSearchResults\"},\"cursor\":null},{\"node\":{\"collated_results\":[{\"ad_archive_id\":\"986911400520635\",\"collation_count\":1,\"collation_id\":\"1042473055303681\",\"page_id\":\"112972480419025\",\"snapshot\":{\"branded_content\":null,\"page_id\":\"112972480419025\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/LumiRed/\",\"root_reshared_post\":null,\"byline\":null,\"disclaimer_label\":null,\"page_name\":\"LumiRed\",\"page_profile_picture_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/674580286_1646070289961650_3873420829896033388_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=a26jwamX0T4Q7kNvwGHYmDn&_nc_oc=AdqgQlIaBWK2f_1k1TJYPw2eF1ulLjmv51gMqn8P_eeBW8SKpkfQlKnZxlfGu9Ilcxw9vgIgVfoR7nx7qTOl2w9F&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=3RYrHKp-JWVepgQ1WrR1fQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af4bzqo_2kXgDnXaEEn9J4iT_OWTINhl1t3vpf25h78J2A&oe=6A0664F9\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"lumired.ie\",\"cta_text\":\"Learn more\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"Aching joints. Tired muscles. That low-level pain that just won't shift.\\n\\nRed light therapy has been used by physiotherapists and sports clinics for years - and now you can bring the same technology home.\\n\\nLumiRed panels use clinically-backed 660nm red and 850nm near-infrared wavelengths to target pain at the source, reduce inflammation, and help your body recover faster.\\n\\n\\u2705 Founded by an Irish physiotherapist\\n\\u2705 Free delivery across Ireland\\n\\u2705 4.9\\u2605 from 163+ verified Irish buyers\\n\\u2705 30-day return policy\\n\\nREDiscover how good your body can feel. Shop at lumired.ie\"},\"cta_type\":\"LEARN_MORE\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":\"Free express delivery across Ireland\",\"link_url\":\"https://lumired.ie/\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Shopping\"],\"page_like_count\":497,\"title\":\"Pain Relief. Better Sleep.\",\"videos\":[{\"video_hd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQO5eqgxuOAsYeaKOz-h