",\"cta_text\":\"Send message\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"Recovery after surgery is not just about rest.\\nIt\\u2019s about supporting the body while it rebuilds. \\ud83c\\udf3f\\n\\nBefore my hip operation, I focused heavily on reducing inflammation, improving circulation, calming my nervous system and preparing my body as well as possible.\\n\\nHyperbaric Oxygen Therapy became a huge part of that journey for me.\\n\\nAfter surgery, I personally found HBOT incredibly supportive for:\\n\\u2728 swelling & stiffness\\n\\u2728 fatigue & recovery\\n\\u2728 sleep & nervous system regulation\\n\\u2728 tissue healing & circulation\\n\\u2728 overall wellbeing during recovery\\n\\u2728\\ufe0f more rested , less brainfog\\n\\nNow I\\u2019m also combining HBOT with full-body Red & Near-Infrared Light Therapy \\u2014 a combination many people use to support circulation, cellular energy, recovery and relaxation.\\n\\nMy scars healed beautifully.\\nMy sleep improved enormously.\\nAnd I genuinely felt stronger, calmer and more supported throughout recovery.\\n\\nAt Oxygen Cove Wellness, we focus on supporting the body during times of physical stress, healing and rebuilding \\u2014 in a calm, safe and restorative environment.\\n\\n\\ud83c\\udf3f Hyperbaric Oxygen Therapy may support:\\n\\u2022 circulation\\n\\u2022 tissue oxygenation\\n\\u2022 inflammation reduction\\n\\u2022 nervous system regulation\\n\\u2022 recovery after surgery\\n\\u2022 post-radiotherapy recovery\\n\\u2022 fatigue & low energy\\n\\u2022 overall recovery and wellbeing\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udccd Cork City\\n\\ud83d\\udce9 DM to ask questions or book\\n\\ud83c\\udf3f Links in bio\\n\\u260e\\ufe0f 087-143 2445\\n\\ud83c\\udf0a Oxygen Cove Wellness\\n5 Father Mathew street\\nCork city centre\\n\\nBreathe Deep. Heal Fully. Thrive Naturally.\"},\"cta_type\":\"INSTAGRAM_MESSAGE\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"http://instagram.com/oxygencovecork\",\"images\":[],\"page_categori