003C100\",\"impressions_index\":0},\"gated_type\":\"ELIGIBLE\",\"categories\":[\"UNKNOWN\"],\"is_aaa_eligible\":true,\"contains_digital_created_media\":false,\"reach_estimate\":null,\"currency\":\"\",\"spend\":null,\"end_date\":1778050800,\"publisher_platform\":[\"FACEBOOK\",\"INSTAGRAM\",\"AUDIENCE_NETWORK\",\"MESSENGER\",\"THREADS\"],\"start_date\":1777446000,\"contains_sensitive_content\":false,\"total_active_time\":null,\"regional_regulation_data\":{\"finserv\":{\"is_deemed_finserv\":false,\"is_limited_delivery\":false},\"tw_anti_scam\":{\"is_limited_delivery\":false}},\"hide_data_status\":\"NONE\",\"fev_info\":null,\"ad_id\":null,\"targeted_or_reached_countries\":[]}],\"__typename\":\"CollatedSearchResults\"},\"cursor\":null},{\"node\":{\"collated_results\":[{\"ad_archive_id\":\"1365096722115870\",\"collation_count\":19,\"collation_id\":\"1000136469207063\",\"page_id\":\"100633432888753\",\"snapshot\":{\"branded_content\":null,\"page_id\":\"100633432888753\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/100088159117018/\",\"root_reshared_post\":null,\"byline\":null,\"disclaimer_label\":null,\"page_name\":\"Huachintong\",\"page_profile_picture_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/684777539_1367588115210688_5557450986004087042_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=oBV-DmWrfU8Q7kNvwGu0rl2&_nc_oc=AdrkGd4ZEn7Q5VUQFhrg9p8JdkODsT4LKVTRJkOUzdHoOpciGFKQ0XsGz24aDhmNCbshJNSjDpBy529U7z93XYzX&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna&_nc_gid=mV67U5VRCsHO11o9bT0Trw&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af6g8hB9SSE2TUpHY5JVd3bjshKWoFaSR2gAM0TX23Rucw&oe=6A065E20\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"healthmaintenanceforme.shop\",\"cta_text\":\"See details\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"Vision decline has never been just about \\\"not seeing clearly.\\\"\\n\\nLuke used to love taking his wife to breakfast at that little family restaurant in town on weekends.\\nBut then, he stopped ordering for himself.\\nNot because the food wasn't good \\u2014 but because he couldn't read the small print on the menu.\\n\\nEvery time the server handed him the menu, he would lean back slightly, squint, pretend to be thinking, and then smile and say:\\n\\\"Honey, you order for me. I love whatever you pick.\\\"\\n\\nHe would eat the whole meal in silence.\\nNot because of his personality \\u2014 but because of embarrassment.\\n\\nBut what bothered him even more were the \\\"little things.\\\"\\n\\nOne day, his granddaughter asked him to read the instructions on a medicine bottle.\\nHe stared at it for a long time, then finally said: \\\"The print is too small. Put it on the table and I'll take another look.\\\"\\nBut even on the table, he couldn't see it clearly.\\nHe didn't want his granddaughter to think Grandpa was old and useless.\\n\\nAt night, driving became harder. He grew more and more afraid of oncoming headlights.\\nNot because his eyes were sensitive to light \\u2014 but because he lacked confidence in himself.\\nHe couldn't see road signs clearly. Couldn't see pedestrians. Couldn't see lane markings.\\nOne rainy day, he almost turned down the wrong street. After that, he voluntarily said: \\\"You drive at night from now on.\\\"\\n\\nHis wife didn't say anything. She just quietly took the keys.\\n\\nHe tried many things.\\n\\nHe bought three pairs of reading glasses with different strengths \\u2014 left one pair at home, one in the car, one in his pocket.\\nHe tried increasing the font size on his phone to maximum, but still couldn't read the medicine instructions.\\nHe even considered surgery, but he was afraid of the risks, the recovery time, and the cost.\\n\\nThen his wife came across BalanceVie online.\\n\\n\\\"Anyway, we have 30 days to get our money back. Just think of it as trying one more time with me,\\\" she said.\\n\\nThe change came faster than he expected.\\n\\nThe first three days \\u2014 nothing. He thought he had wasted his money again.\\nBut on the fifth night, he suddenly noticed that the text on his phone didn't seem as blurry as before.\\n\\nIn the second week, he voluntarily picked up a takeout menu from the restaurant \\u2014 squinted at it for ten seconds, and actually read three menu items out loud.\\nHis wife was stunned. Then she smiled. Harder than he had seen her smile in a long time.\\n\\nIn the third week, he did something he hadn't dared to do in ages:\\nHe drove himself to the supermarket.\\nHe made it back home, having read the road signs, the traffic light countdowns, and the parking space lines.\\nHe walked in the door, put down the keys, and said:\\n\\\"I'll drive tomorrow night. Let's go out for dinner.\\\"\\n\\nHe said: BalanceVie isn't selling glasses.\\n\\n\\\"I've bought a lot of eye care products, but BalanceVie is different.\\nNot because it's magical \\u2014 but because it actually made me believe in myself again.\\\"\\n\\nThree minutes a day. Sit on the couch. Put on the glasses. Watch a short show or just close your eyes and rest.\\nNo surgery. No time off work. No pain.\\n\\nWe could keep telling you about NASA technology, mitochondrial charging, and scientific principles.\\nBut we'd rather let Luke's words speak for themselves:\\n\\n\\\"I can read menus now. I can drive at night. I can read instructions on my own.\\nBut what makes me happiest is that my granddaughter no longer feels like Grandpa is useless.\\\"\\n\\nThis is not a pair of glasses.\\nThis is independence and dignity \\u2014 given back.\\n\\n\\ud83c\\udf81 Order today and get 50\\u0025 OFF\\n\\ud83e\\udde7 First 100 customers receive a mystery gift box\\n\\ud83d\\udd12 30-day money-back guarantee \\u2014 not satisfied? We'll take the risk.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udc49 [Try it \\u2014 you can always return it]\\n\\u23f0 50\\u0025 OFF ends tonight at 11:59 pm\"},\"cta_type\":\"SEE_DETAILS\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"https://healthmaintenanceforme.shop/visioncorrectioninfraredglasses_en/Glasses_2\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Bar\",\"Restaurant\"],\"page_like_count\":21,\"title\":\"\\\"I Finally Don't Have to Ask My Wife to Read the Menu for Me\\\" \\u2014 Luke, 62\",\"videos\":[{\"video_hd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQNDMlIotJRFIaL-i76W0kwhtupulQZIEtNwoZoWvX0YxIbKm5MUgEwfjq7NIw6fk7sLbrCbg-zUL2js6Hp2y4nrRFuTqTe2at_042kf1Ge3IQ.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=AdqzMH9vgU_YDBjB--2eCKFg9jFoatPswv0M7dkSUirfmhaGYr5mUT9k14gt83EBl1bEBfFpReIxqq7VPY_mbyh9&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=yd1v-TML-LEQ7kNvwEZrU0r&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHAiLCJ4cHZfYXNzZXRfaWQiOjk4ODE4OTIyNDE2NTk0MywiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjYsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwNzk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjoyMzAsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ\\u00253D\\u00253D&ccb=17-1&vs=aa4ae738ac3e1560&_nc_&_nc_gid=mV67U5VRCsHO11o9bT0Trw&_nc_ss=7b2a8&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_Af4gGgwZH5L4TMd10HxKsLbLp64VcKsEkZywyue7En-Nnw&oe=6A06601F\",\"video_preview_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/686516353_1485151043072999_1902129904319525356_n.jpg?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=9qa94LbIqoQQ7kNvwGjmI_C&_nc_oc=AdqjRgjdMlcYzgd1VB0mXr9SmvfptndDgLmygbbFqMf6mPVax20P2wAFB711jBevvJTD3x46UNjWGHo8e-uZrJoj&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=mV67U5VRCsHO11o9bT0Trw&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af5sRS5iuMC3o2YsQ85Z9k_JIAQKeDj7X9cuqJL2vtUIRQ&oe=6A067FE3\",\"video_sd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m412/AQNhxgj-xfYuGyy0lh6NQez1G4oL13Y_DdbO7O2o3Vymdg1ortkYZ-qIc6AbL4_P1pQmaqW2nKHgcv35wKtF5hZy0h5TBI-Zfe1kLO5xxA.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=AdoB6yv8Rnr-cne2e5mQdeS9ixtax0XytVpeeIQDk2gzk1H43d-Lqf_55yge2VcRhBxJ4mM7o-NoL_D_9rT9pN4K&_nc_sid=8bf8fe&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=2C3yQvoHJO0Q7kNvwEvThfp&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuMzYwLnN2ZV9zZCIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6OTg4MTg5MjI0MTY1OTQzLCJhc3NldF9hZ2VfZGF5cyI6NiwidmlfdXNlY2FzZV9pZCI6MTA3OTksImR1cmF0aW9uX3MiOjIzMCwidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=mV67U5VRCsHO11o9bT0Trw&_nc_ss=7b2a8&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_Af7F-MNv3SDtDLTsOSH_fJsgX2jWZoxd8bWBXJkXqpfTzg&oe=6A0673CF\",\"watermarked_video_hd_url\":null,\"watermarked_video_sd_url\":null}],\"is_reshared\":false,\"extra_links\":[],\"extra_texts\":[],\"extra_images\":[],\"extra_videos\":[],\"country_iso_code\":null,\"brazil_tax_id\":null,\"additional_info\":null,\"ec_certificates\":[]},\"is_active\":true,\"has_user_reported\":false,\"report_count\":null,\"menu_items\":[],\"state_media_run_label\":null,\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_name\":\"Huachintong\",\"impressions_with_index\":{\"impressions_text\":\"\\u003C100\",\"impressions_index\":0},\"gated_type\":\"ELIGIBLE\",\"categories\":[\"UNKNOWN\"],\"is_aaa_eligible\":true,\"contains_digital_created_media\":false,\"reach_estimate\":null,\"currency\":\"\",\"spend\":null,\"end_date\":1778310000,\"publisher_platform\":[\"FACEBOOK\",\"INSTAGRAM\"],\"start_date\":1777878000,\"contains_sensitive_content\":false,\"total_active_time\":78618,\"regional_regulation_data\":{\"finserv\":{\"is_deemed_finserv\":false,\"is_limited_delivery\":false},\"tw_anti_scam\":{\"is_limited_delivery\":false}},\"hide_data_status\":\"NONE\",\"fev_info\":null,\"ad_id\":null,\"targeted_or_reached_countries\":[]},{\"ad_archive_id\":\"3416337795196704\",\"collation_count\":null,\"collation_id\":\"1000136469207063\",\"page_id\":\"100633432888753\",\"snapshot\":{\"branded_content\":null,\"page_id\":\"100633432888753\",\"page_is_deleted\":false,\"page_profile_uri\":\"https://www.facebook.com/100088159117018/\",\"root_reshared_post\":null,\"byline\":null,\"disclaimer_label\":null,\"page_name\":\"Huachintong\",\"page_profile_picture_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/686322675_1496915418506953_7221072466266287539_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=Hwe9mqNz6aIQ7kNvwGMiCjf&_nc_oc=Adphgr2Q8BMWuNxGdpvNXiK9EUPuCaiBRIoy7y8JNrAd4khnz-fgdXnrxk8Ops8XPs398CUzHHuN7J8ueT1yAhOH&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=mV67U5VRCsHO11o9bT0Trw&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af5oXnt0_6zqTFMWJo0VyAx25L9HP7s_YY2KWyai0-32IA&oe=6A067F0B\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"healthmaintenanceforme.shop\",\"cta_text\":\"See details\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"Vision decline has never been just about \\\"not seeing clearly.\\\"\\n\\nLuke used to love taking his wife to breakfast at that little family restaurant in town on weekends.\\nBut then, he stopped ordering for himself.\\nNot because the food wasn't good \\u2014 but because he couldn't read the small print on the menu.\\n\\nEvery time the server handed him the menu, he would lean back slightly, squint, pretend to be thinking, and then smile and say:\\n\\\"Honey, you order for me. I love whatever you pick.\\\"\\n\\nHe would eat the whole meal in silence.\\nNot because of his personality \\u2014 but because of embarrassment.\\n\\nBut what bothered him even more were the \\\"little things.\\\"\\n\\nOne day, his granddaughter asked him to read the instructions on a medicine bottle.\\nHe stared at it for a long time, then finally said: \\\"The print is too small. Put it on the table and I'll take another look.\\\"\\nBut even on the table, he couldn't see it clearly.\\nHe didn't want his granddaughter to think Grandpa was old and useless.\\n\\nAt night, driving became harder. He grew more and more afraid of oncoming headlights.\\nNot because his eyes were sensitive to light \\u2014 but because he lacked confidence in himself.\\nHe couldn't see road signs clearly. Couldn't see pedestrians. Couldn't see lane markings.\\nOne rainy day, he almost turned down the wrong street. After that, he voluntarily said: \\\"You drive at night from now on.\\\"\\n\\nHis wife didn't say anything. She just quietly took the keys.\\n\\nHe tried many things.\\n\\nHe bought three pairs of reading glasses with different strengths \\u2014 left one pair at home, one in the car, one in his pocket.\\nHe tried increasing the font size on his phone to maximum, but still couldn't read the medicine instructions.\\nHe even considered surgery, but he was afraid of the risks, the recovery time, and the cost.\\n\\nThen his wife came across BalanceVie online.\\n\\n\\\"Anyway, we have 30 days to get our money back. Just think of it as trying one more time with me,\\\" she said.\\n\\nThe change came faster than he expected.\\n\\nThe first three days \\u2014 nothing. He thought he had wasted his money again.\\nBut on the fifth night, he suddenly noticed that the text on his phone didn't seem as blurry as before.\\n\\nIn the second week, he voluntarily picked up a takeout menu from the restaurant \\u2014 squinted at it for ten seconds, and actually read three menu items out loud.\\nHis wife was stunned. Then she smiled. Harder than he had seen her smile in a long time.\\n\\nIn the third week, he did something he hadn't dared to do in ages:\\nHe drove himself to the supermarket.\\nHe made it back home, having read the road signs, the traffic light countdowns, and the parking space lines.\\nHe walked in the door, put down the keys, and said:\\n\\\"I'll drive tomorrow night. Let's go out for dinner.\\\"\\n\\nHe said: BalanceVie isn't selling glasses.\\n\\n\\\"I've bought a lot of eye care products, but BalanceVie is different.\\nNot because it's magical \\u2014 but because it actually made me believe in myself again.\\\"\\n\\nThree minutes a day. Sit on the couch. Put on the glasses. Watch a short show or just close your eyes and rest.\\nNo surgery. No time off work. No pain.\\n\\nWe could keep telling you about NASA technology, mitochondrial charging, and scientific principles.\\nBut we'd rather let Luke's words speak for themselves:\\n\\n\\\"I can read menus now. I can drive at night. I can read instructions on my own.\\nBut what makes me happiest is that my granddaughter no longer feels like Grandpa is useless.\\\"\\n\\nThis is not a pair of glasses.\\nThis is independence and dignity \\u2014 given back.\\n\\n\\ud83c\\udf81 Order today and get 50\\u0025 OFF\\n\\ud83e\\udde7 First 100 customers receive a mystery gift box\\n\\ud83d\\udd12 30-day money-back guarantee \\u2014 not satisfied? We'll take the risk.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udc49 [Try it \\u2014 you can always return it]\\n\\u23f0 50\\u0025 OFF ends tonight at 11:59 pm\"},\"cta_type\":\"SEE_DETAILS\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":null,\"link_url\":\"https://healthmaintenanceforme.shop/visioncorrectioninfraredglasses_en/Glasses_2\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Bar\",\"Restaurant\"],\"page_like_count\":21,\"title\":\"\\\"I Finally Don't Have to Ask My Wife to Read the Menu for Me\\\" \\u2014 Luke, 62\",\"videos\":[{\"video_hd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQNDMlIotJRFIaL-i76W0kwhtupulQZIEtNwoZoWvX0YxIbKm5MUgEwfjq7NIw6fk7sLbrCbg-zUL2js6Hp2y4nrRFuTqTe2at_042kf1Ge3IQ.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=AdqzMH9vgU_YDBjB--2eCKFg9jFoatPswv0M7dkSUirfmhaGYr5mUT9k14gt83EBl1bEBfFpReIxqq7VPY_mbyh9&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=yd1v-TML-LEQ7kNvwEZrU0r&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHAiLCJ4cHZfYXNzZXRfaWQiOjk4ODE4OTIyNDE2NTk0MywiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjYsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwNzk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjoyMzAsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ\\u00253D\\u00253D&ccb=17-1&vs=aa4ae738ac3e1560&_nc_&_nc_gid=mV67U5VRCsHO11o9bT0Trw&_nc_ss=7b2a8&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_Af4gGgwZH5L4TMd10HxKsLbLp64VcKsEkZywyue7En-Nnw&oe=6A06601F\",\"video_preview_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/687033130_995289463079955_2183391910861837460_n.jpg?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=yXyw3Qy3Gu0Q7kNvwFOKYTA&_nc_oc=AdpToQqmm8prD5B3zPZl-LKyC9hssoeAGqrJVsxr6B9WZDm8PXNYGFyDQd3axs2pfq3zSv037MtKaP5Bq2pIVbIB&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna&_nc_gid=mV67U5VRCsHO11o9bT0Trw&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af7CTbq6TmoRGG