pVx6myL_U5zRdMgAbtaurrJqVFbunI68voS8lQBO8g&oe=6A065FBC\",\"event\":null,\"caption\":\"rouge.care\",\"cta_text\":\"Shop now\",\"cards\":[],\"body\":{\"text\":\"G4 panels deliver red and near-infrared light using 8 targeted wavelengths, coverage up to 1060 nm, and strong measured irradiance.\\n\\nResearch on photobiomodulation suggests potential support for:\\n\\u2022 Skin health\\n\\u2022 Muscle recovery\\n\\u2022 Joint comfort\\n\\u2022 Cellular energy production\\n\\nSmart presets make daily sessions simple, so you can focus on your goals.\"},\"cta_type\":\"SHOP_NOW\",\"display_format\":\"VIDEO\",\"link_description\":\"Trusted by Health Professionals\",\"link_url\":\"https://rouge.care/en-eu/collections/rouge-g4-panels\",\"images\":[],\"page_categories\":[\"Health & wellness website\"],\"page_like_count\":2877,\"title\":\"Red Light Therapy Panel\",\"videos\":[{\"video_hd_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQPbGiYv0_EY5LTVLcTwChK8ugr6s8WivWObaC3woKAtYv8JgOvJiYYN8h3NbDb7Yhury4ZRx3KtMr21QsFu9pIUGHVZj30TYdpPTXOMbJ8axw.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=AdpxntGGTiF2rIl_vxTgst7B-e5CtOdD5u_mExu9XQRKJDQJgtGBCV5iDgyUp5Wq4TYDKlcODdahpqWR9_7FTeZX&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent.fdub4-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=K3ClpKDWVJUQ7kNvwGH5Maw&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHAiLCJ4cHZfYXNzZXRfaWQiOjE2NDQ2MjYwMzk5OTE0MjEsImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjo0NCwidmlfdXNlY2FzZV9pZCI6MTAxMzksImR1cmF0aW9uX3MiOjMxLCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0\\u00253D&ccb=17-1&vs=b3ddcf5e89ec709&_nc_&_nc_gid=6-kTPdJNsTzJsSbLLp8ccA&_nc_ss=7b2a8&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_Af75s8YLIq8AIU8mFy1N4pSq8Vo3kigxWHeNGM5ZD-Hsdw&oe=6A068C41\",\"video_preview_image_url\":\"https://scontent.fdub8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/683063137_900489613033044_1282778345646390778_n.jpg?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=W6n_LvDAsbEQ7kNvwG6ABfF&_nc_oc=AdqOkXE71WynXtZb8sQ6kpn4jL8Gg0ikD4pTD5hmAPHy0fv0SdwufPPw0_JcBqVUZVbjMPUoBT1UEZtZ6FOXBRS9&_nc_zt=